(84, 'INRA00008026', NULL, NULL, 132, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Miyapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Miyapur', 'Madinaguda', 'Madinaguda', NULL, 98, '98', '17.5169014', '78.3428304', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2025', NULL, 'RERA', '12345', '01-01-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.05', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/Uklw5wLyaYGBtINcpr2wAVIeyF9E0JS9wcXRfIlc.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 5, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1190', '1965', 9, 6, '<h2><strong>Gautami Heights, Miyapur – Premium Gated Community</strong></h2><p>Discover modern luxury and serene living at <strong>Gautami Heights</strong> by Anuhar Homes. Located in the thriving hub of Miyapur, Hyderabad, this <strong>fully gated 2-acre community</strong> offers the perfect balance of urban connectivity and peaceful green spaces.</p><p>With <strong>59% dedicated open space</strong>, you can escape the city\'s hustle without leaving home.</p><h3><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Space &amp; Structure:</strong> 10 floors featuring 243 exclusive units.</li><li><strong>Apartment Types:</strong> Premium, well-ventilated 2, 2.5, and 3 BHK flats.</li><li><strong>Ample Parking:</strong> Hassle-free 3-level car parking.</li><li><strong>Top-Tier Security:</strong> 24/7 manned security checkpoints and full CCTV coverage.</li><li><strong>100% Verified:</strong> Fully RERA approved <strong>(RERA No. P02400006604)</strong>.</li></ul><p>Enjoy an elevated lifestyle close to top IT hubs, schools, and the metro. <strong>Schedule a site visit today!</strong></p>', NULL, '100', '50', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/7bcHwwMM2vcfMd9KxspMtyQg0IikVy3uovUiXB6C.pdf', '2026-01-01', NULL, '1', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 98, '2026-06-02 09:20:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '02/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(89, 'INRB00008926', NULL, NULL, 136, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available in Bachupally Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 3, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Bachupally', 'Miyapur', 'road no.36', NULL, 101, '101', '17.5555144', '78.3625779', 'GHMC', 'P02200004832', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', '4532654325', '01-01-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4.5', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/4oWl6sRzROBfpE5BdNPuR6MqbThGU6VWpUtPoom5.png', 'sq.ft', NULL, 7, 2996, NULL, NULL, 0, '1157', '2412', 9, 6, '<p>Praneeth Pranav Solitaire is a thoughtfully designed residential community that blends modern living with everyday comfort. Spread across approximately <strong>4.5 acres</strong>, this premium development offers a well-balanced lifestyle with spacious homes, open areas, and essential amenities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '50', '50', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/jMs8k2VIj56Ja14o7IKVM6GTgRjH3s0HNbBqH9uS.pdf', '2025-09-05', NULL, '2 years', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 101, '2026-06-02 10:38:21', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '02/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 'INRA00009026', NULL, NULL, 133, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kachiguda Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kollur', 'Kollur', 'kollur', NULL, 95, '95', '17.4435941', '78.2508532', 'GHMC', '003833/BP/HMDA/0800/SKP/2024', '02-06-2026', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/9nSoS9J9X94vTcAHJt8PWDqikQXksr6Iya6NDVJ9.pdf', 'RERA', 'P0110000933', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.62', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/5vedxJ4GGmzBPwYpQt1mLXEgycobThAdxIRvNY81.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 9, 97, NULL, NULL, 16, '1395', '1985', 9, 8, '<p><strong>Vian Mrida – Premium Apartments in Kollur, Hyderabad</strong></p><p>Vian Mrida offers thoughtfully designed 2 &amp; 3 BHK apartments in the fast-growing locality of Kollur, Hyderabad. Featuring modern architecture, premium amenities, spacious layouts, and excellent connectivity to ORR, Gachibowli, and the Financial District, the project is ideal for families and investors seeking a comfortable and future-ready lifestyle.</p><p><strong>Highlights:</strong><br>Premium 2 &amp; 3 BHK Apartments<br>Prime Location – Kollur, Hyderabad<br>&nbsp;Modern Amenities &amp; Clubhouse</p><p>Excellent Connectivity to IT Hubs<br>Peaceful &amp; Fast-Growing Neighborhood</p><p><strong>Live smart. Invest wisely. Choose Vian Mrida.</strong></p>', NULL, '100', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/f0wYwDDjmIswwdWJnN7NQCgIDIk72q5JobyhHpUu.pdf', '2026-06-02', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 95, '2026-06-02 11:10:32', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '02/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, 'INRA00009226', NULL, NULL, 139, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Nizampet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Nizampet', 'Nizampet', 'Industrial Estate', NULL, 101, '2', '17.5072404', '78.3917702', 'GHMC', '2646GHMCKPL', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', '2646GHMCKPL', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8.31', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/HnJmIk5OmNl4trC3DLXbpOPelWsJ7X49WiiMyPdZ.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 7, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1356', '3130', 9, 7, '<p><strong>Praneeth PBR-Pranav Ixora</strong> is an elite, luxury residential community developed by Praneeth Group. Located in the energetic neighborhood of <strong>JNTU, Hydernagar in Hyderabad</strong>, it is designed as a sprawling landmark project that prioritizes sophistication, privacy, and community living.</p><ul><li><strong>Total Area:</strong> 8.31 acres.</li><li><strong>Total Inventory:</strong> 1,504 flats.</li><li><strong>Apartment Types:</strong> Spacious 2, 2.5, 3, and 3.5 BHK premium homes featuring city and lake views.</li></ul>', NULL, '1890', '2000', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/smINrqKfeTd3jLkTO10b01VGuMeQaDvdyqpsd5xp.pdf', '2027-01-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 101, '2026-06-02 12:02:47', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-11 12:51:02', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '02/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(95, 'INRA00009526', NULL, NULL, 137, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Nallagandla Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Nallagandla', 'Nallagandla', 'Nallagandla', NULL, 99, '99', '17.4747785', '78.3102918', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2025', NULL, 'RERA', '12345', '01-01-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10.38', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/EWu4sQu5pJ0cT9BhKlBkn180iQTEL5S4NIYlkRnf.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16, '1733', '2751', 9, 7, '<p>Tridasa Rise is more than a home. It\'s a place where you truly shine. Here, every sunrise brings warmth, every breeze whispers calm, and every moment feels alive with aspirations.</p><p>Designed to blend nature\'s beauty with modern comfort, Tridasa Rise offers a home where light fills your spaces and joy fills your days. It\'s where your story unfolds amid green gardens, open skies, and thoughtful details crafted just for you. Come home to Tridasa Rise - where life\'s brightest moments are yours to cherish.</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/lPea7i7SDhcWsn0sPI6XWGmMUWjQdGNvdtBTbDpT.pdf', '2030-01-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 99, '2026-06-03 06:33:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 'INRA00009626', NULL, NULL, 141, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Tellapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tellapur', 'Tellapur', '100 feet road, Tellapur', NULL, 115, '115', '17.4504819', '78.3858169', 'PANCHAYAT', 'P01100005595', '03-10-2022', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100005595', '30-12-2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '11', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/LkFgu67qZhirsszdU9fXgnC2aB4GTu56zy338MXI.png', 'sq.ft', NULL, 9, 9000, NULL, NULL, 16, '139', '2700', 9, 7, '<ul><li>Premium gated residential community spread across <strong>11 acres</strong> in <strong>Tellapur, Hyderabad</strong>.</li><li>Strategically located on the <strong>100 Feet Road</strong>, close to the <strong>Financial District, Gachibowli, and major IT hubs</strong>.</li><li>Comprises <strong>7 high-rise towers</strong> with <strong>1,561 thoughtfully designed apartments</strong>.</li><li>Offers <strong>90+ lifestyle amenities</strong>, including a <strong>45,000 sq. ft. clubhouse</strong> and a dedicated <strong>10,000 sq. ft. sports complex</strong>.</li><li>Features landscaped open spaces, children\'s play areas, fitness zones, co-working spaces, and recreational facilities.</li><li>Designed with modern architecture, quality construction, and future-ready infrastructure for a comfortable and vibrant lifestyle.</li><li>An ideal choice for both <strong>end-users and investors</strong> seeking premium living and strong appreciation potential in Hyderabad.</li></ul>', NULL, '100', '50', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/Q0cnXxvD6XL961cZzMAxg3xQHtjdMqgrdnIdwLgR.pdf', '2026-12-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 115, '2026-06-03 06:38:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(97, 'INRA00009726', NULL, NULL, 145, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Bowrampet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Medchal', 'Bowrampet', 'Adjacent to ORR Service Rd', NULL, 122, '100', '17.5525118', '78.3000814', 'GHMC', '122372021', '01-01-2021', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200002810', '01-01-2021', NULL, 'HMDA', '122372021', '2021-01-01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.3', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/GtpGN81jpaEdrp4a7FCEpUuiWkk1LNf9TjAmHPQT.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 8, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1100', '1700', 9, 7, '<p>Speed Sanarelli is a gated residential community located at <strong>Bowrampet, Hyderabad</strong>, just one minute from <strong>ORR Exit 5</strong>. Developed by Kura Homes / Speed Housing LLP, the project is designed as a low-density residential development that emphasizes open spaces, efficient planning, and long-term land value rather than high-rise congestion. The community is spread across approximately <strong>5.3 acres</strong> and comprises <strong>756 apartments</strong> distributed across <strong>five </strong>residential towers, each rising to Stilt + 12 floors.</p><p>The master plan is organized around five residential towers positioned within a central landscaped campus. The layout prioritizes internal open areas, circulation roads, recreation zones, and clubhouse facilities while maintaining adequate spacing between towers for ventilation and natural light. Sources indicate approximately <strong>30 feet of separation </strong>between towers, improving privacy and reducing the dense feel common in larger apartment projects.</p>', NULL, '50', '75', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/PY4PyIYEdkxVttwO50aygQdmY2C30tCxCrHZDPrN.pdf', '2026-12-31', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 122, '2026-06-03 08:52:26', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(98, 'INRA00009826', NULL, NULL, 147, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Bachupally Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Bachupally', 'Miyapur', 'Miyapur Rd', NULL, 123, '97', '17.5384158', '78.3589976', 'GHMC', 'P02200007361', '02-09-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200007361', '02-09-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.35', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/oETIIkeLCsgEEtxXvNgICq5YdvvLBPT407Z1kL0Q.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 7, 240, NULL, NULL, 16, '1194', '1791', 9, 7, '<p><strong>Skyler</strong> is a prestigious, modern high-rise gated community residential project designed and developed by <strong>TMSR Infra Pvt Ltd</strong>. Marketed with the guiding philosophy of \"Peace, Prosperity, Joy Forever,\" the project aims to blend aesthetic design, thoughtfulness, and practicality to deliver an enhanced, sophisticated living experience.</p><ul><li><strong>Total Area:</strong> 2.5 Acres</li><li><strong>Total Inventory:</strong> 549 Units</li><li><strong>Building Configuration:</strong> G+32 Floors across 2 Wings</li><li><strong>Unit Types:</strong> 2, 2.5, and 3 BHK luxury apartments</li><li><strong>Unit Sizes:</strong> Ranging from 1194 SFT to 1791 SFT</li><li><strong>Parking:</strong> 4 Levels of dedicated parking</li></ul>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/j7ebvNUmxr1ZVBTmcdH5PbHaXZXKGGMsdiqjo1Jw.pdf', '2028-09-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 123, '2026-06-03 08:56:32', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 'INRA00009926', NULL, NULL, 150, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kollur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kollur', 'Kollur', 'Kollur', NULL, 103, '103', '17.4598575', '78.2609233', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2025', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100007243', '01-01-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/6vdrjL3oR2wcKghWWwT8oBInSwOdbBrVa1Rgy3Un.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 22, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1375', '2205', 9, 7, '<p>You have an uncommon taste for style and refinement. Your remarkable journey embodies the pinnacle of success, blending personal achievement with a life of grandeur.</p><p>We are inspired by your profile. We strive for creating a lifestyle that harmoniously combines success and luxury. We have a home that blends with your remarkable achievements. Live in a sanctuary where you connect, collaborate and cultivate relationships for an enriching lifestyle.</p><p>Experience an exceptional environment that matches your jet-setting lifestyle. Be it Kokapet SEZ or Neopolis IT SEZ, reach your global office unruffled as you drive on ORR. Live a life of privilege with endless possibilities, where aspirations find their reality. At <strong>Elegant Nivasa</strong>, every aspect has been carefully curated to provide a living experience that transcends expectations. Come, join a distinguished community who call this destination their home.</p><p><strong>Elegant Nivasa </strong>is where you can be all yourself! It is designed for a successful person who leads his corporate team, keeps family on cloud nine, and takes the spotlight in the community. You’ll never get to compromise for anything here. It\'s about the time you get what you deserve. It’s a home that unleashes your true potential.</p><blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Elegant Nivasa at Tellapur offers well-planned 2 &amp; 3 BHK apartments that combine everyday comfort with long-term value.</i></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><i>Located in one of Hyderabad’s fastest-growing residential corridors, it’s the perfect choice for families and investors alike.</i></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><i>Quality construction and thoughtful design</i></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><i>Attractive pricing in a high-demand area</i></p></blockquote>', NULL, '50', '50', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/nSuo7Icjx3oLlyLDE1ra7d5NYqdDo9h0fDnTETa4.pdf', '2027-06-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 103, '2026-06-03 09:30:03', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-28 06:21:14', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 'INRB00010026', NULL, NULL, 140, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kokapet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 3, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kokapet', 'Golden Mile Extension Road, Kokapet, near Nehru Outer Ring Road, Exit 1, Hyderabad, Telangana 500075', 'kokapet', NULL, 106, '2', '17.4043558', '78.3299297', 'GHMC', 'P02400007478', '01-02-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400007478', '01-02-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3.61', 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/595DEZm4MS3djwBiHqulb0X2E3j3E8fBVXpn5DdM.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 10, 7000, NULL, NULL, 0, '2640', '3775', 9, 7, '<p><strong>Lansum Elena</strong> is an under-construction, luxury lakeside residential project in Kokapet, Hyderabad. Spread across 3.61 acres, it features two iconic 55-floor towers with 540 spacious 3 and 4 BHK apartments. Slated for completion in December 2028, prices start at ₹2.9 Cr</p>', NULL, '150', '75', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/NPttNghrQDfBaS7S8timvhcni5dMY6twBHZ2iQhS.pdf', '2028-01-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 106, '2026-06-03 10:09:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(101, 'INRA00010126', NULL, NULL, 152, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Ghatkesar Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kompally', 'Gowdavalli', 'Basuragadi Village', NULL, 104, '104', '17.589206', '78.473358', 'GHMC', 'P02200004777', '01-08-2022', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200004777', '01-08-2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/ERQTZlQAoeqUmDgQpsJ8dpNOiwAcbxUEkxYmvRfy.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 3, 250, NULL, NULL, 7, '1020', '1310', 9, 6, '<p><strong>Bonsai Cedar</strong> is a modern, urban residential development by <strong>Bonsai Housing</strong> designed to blend cosmopolitan living with nature. The project is uniquely positioned right next to a forest, offering residents a peaceful and green environment.</p><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Kompally, Hyderabad (specifically located at Ayodhya X Road, Gowdavelli).</li><li><strong>Configurations:</strong> <strong>2 &amp; 3 BHK</strong> apartments.</li><li><strong>Project Size:</strong> A sleek, exclusive community consisting of <strong>90 elegantly designed units</strong>.</li><li><strong>RERA Approved:</strong> Registered under RERA No: <strong>P02200004777</strong></li><li>&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Structure &amp; Design:</strong> Built as an RCC framed structure using high-quality fly ash or porotherm bricks.</li><li><strong>Interiors:</strong> Finished with sleek vitrified tile flooring, emulsion wall paints, and high-quality UPVC windows and French doors.</li><li><strong>Utilities &amp; Power:</strong> Features a soundproof generator providing <strong>full power backup</strong> for all lights and fans, dedicated overhead water tanks, and a Sewage Treatment Plant (STP).</li><li><strong>Security &amp; Safety:</strong> Equipped with <strong>CCTV surveillance</strong> throughout the project and <strong>solar fencing</strong> on the boundary walls</li></ul>', NULL, '20', '20',