(108, 'INRA00010826', 129, NULL, 174, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Tellapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tellapur', 'Tellapur', NULL, NULL, 104, '104', '17.4733', '78.2966064', 'GHMC', '0346/HMDA/SWBP/2025', '01-10-2025', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100010180', '01-10-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3.03', 12, '3', '12', '264', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/K743PtDhEkEl92SCvUhgyeICUAJmZ7NmMBUSTzrg.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 7, 500, NULL, NULL, 16, '1785', '2450', 9, 7, '<p>Bonsai Fern, developed by Bonsai Housing, is situated at Tellapur Hyderabad, offering a premium residential experience. This project features a total of 264, designed with modern living in mind. The homes here are available in 3 BHK, catering to diverse family sizes and needs.</p><p>Priced from ₹ 1.44 Cr to ₹ 1.98 Cr, these residences offer a blend of luxury and comfort. The development spans across 3.02 Acres and boasts Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, 24*7 Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Clubhouse, Indoor Games. 3 BHK Flats are available, ranging from 1785 Sq.Ft. to 2450 Sq.Ft.. The New Launch ensures a timely handover. With 1 residential blocks, this property provides ample space and privacy.</p>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/UK2Qsb6xLTbSDSwCEkxNZoHNLs6eWgOFnwVTisaZ.pdf', '2030-10-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 104, '2026-06-04 10:12:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '04/06/2026', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
