(111, 'INRA00011126', 142, NULL, 189, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kokapet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kokapet', 'kokapet', 'shanti nagar road', NULL, 127, '127', '17.396872', '78.332389', 'GHMC', 'P02400009394', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400009394', '01-01-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.24', 12, '1', '34', '102', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/FSiIv1DOlhR7nWdlFMwdDt8rquYcttG58zRh6d3r.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 6, 6500, NULL, NULL, 16, '3315', '3575', 9, 6, '<p><strong>Evania by AVR</strong> is a premium gated community. Located in Kokapet (near the Neopolis layout) in Hyderabad, it features a single-tower, low-density luxury residential design with extensive security and lifestyle amenities.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/VLTxkVleKfMBuOCosxcd19ErHDxC6DTMXli8QtO3.pdf', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 127, '2026-06-05 07:44:17', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '05/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(112, 'INRA00011226', 141, NULL, 188, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Patancheru Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Patancheru', 'Patancheru', 'Patancheru', NULL, 126, '126', '17.5270021', '78.2818618', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2022', NULL, 'RERA', 'POIT00007322', '01-01-2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.05', 12, '8', '5', '425', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/0Liua8KjSzb04HqxGUANl9vh73ZSjHsoyVJXh2Og.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 20, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1100', '1620', 9, 7, '<p>Where does your search for a perfect home take you? Is it peace and prosperity you seek? Is your home a place for self expression and for bonding with loved ones? Jai Sri Devi Homes unveils Devi Homes Samruddhi – a secure gated community of plush apartments and lifestyle amenities in the heart of Patancheru.</p><h2>THIS IS WHERE LIFE THRIVES​</h2><p>Embark on a journey to prosperity with Devi Homes Samruddhi witness the rise of a new landmark symbolizing growth, stability and a future filled with success. Join us as we build the future.</p><h2>THIS IS WHERE THE HEART IS</h2><p>Caring and sensitivity can transform the ordinary to extraordinary. The blocks within the layout have been designed to let in sunshine and stardust, cool breeze and good vibes. There is equal focus on active outdoor spaces and the facilities of a stunning Clubhouse. Take a fresh view of the future from the luxurious world of Devi Homes Samruddhi.</p>', NULL, '100', '50', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/HPiHORk1WRpLDyG5QFvizDfdHixbB6kydHkqHZLD.pdf', '2026-10-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 126, '2026-06-05 09:16:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '05/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(113, 'INRA00011326', 144, NULL, 191, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kokapet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kokapet', NULL, NULL, NULL, 103, '103', '17.3876219', '78.3401237', 'HMDA', '005387/BP/HMDA/1211/SKP/2024', '01-04-2025', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400009501', '01-04-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.2', 12, '1', '63', '210', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/mnUlscyLY7b5FtuQlW3uE0z7mTg2OIDXoB52MOjw.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 10, 1500, NULL, NULL, 16, '5662', '6278', 9, 7, '<p><strong>Skyven Kokapet</strong> is an ultra-luxury, high-rise residential skyscraper located in the prime Financial District corridor of Hyderabad. Developed by VR Pingle and E-Infra, it is South India’s tallest residential tower. The single, architectural-landmark tower spans 63 floors, reaching a height of 755 feet, and offers just 210 exclusive 4 BHK residences.&nbsp;</p><p>Expansive layouts ranging from 5,662 sq. ft. to 6,278 sq. ft</p>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/xrSp28dFlbT6JVuBkLqCwmONyf6zFG6pyE7zJzBv.pdf', '2030-02-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 103, '2026-06-05 09:40:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '05/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
