(116, 'INRA00011626', 149, NULL, 195, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Snehita hills Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Snehita hills', 'Appa Junction', 'Appa Junction', NULL, 128, '128', '17.3540328', '78.3686027', 'HMDA', '12345', '01-01-1', NULL, 'RERA', 'P024400008864, PO2400008820', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 12, '2', '5', '20', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/F9Q36Up80UDPKFCWbR3hcb9IIJqbGvocHelbQW0I.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 5, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '2025', '2030', 9, 7, '<h2>Saanvi Arena Homes – Exclusive 3BHK Luxury Apartments in Peeramcheru, Appa Junction, Hyderabad</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Discover your ideal home in the heart of Peeramcheru with our exclusive collection of 40 luxurious 3BHK apartments. Thoughtfully designed for modern living, these residences offer a perfect blend of elegance and functionality.</p><p>Enjoy seamless connectivity to key city locations while experiencing a serene and peaceful lifestyle. With premium amenities and a focus on comfort, this project provides an unmatched opportunity to live the life you’ve always dreamed of. Your journey toward owning the perfect home starts here.</p><p>The way we look at a home has changed today. When we seek a home, we seek a lot more from it. We seek aesthetics, we seek quality, we seek pride, we seek value<br>-and all of this makes it picture-perfect.<br>Here arrives Saanvi Arena Homes.</p>', NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/pHbm26ehSJ1v1oDrYip7JnPlViT5NJvQhacAgPdX.pdf', '2027-07-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 128, '2026-06-05 10:53:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '05/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
