(121, 'INRA00012126', 151, NULL, 194, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Tellapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tellapur', 'Osmansagar', NULL, NULL, 124, '124', '17.4384357', '78.2747434', 'HMDA', 'P01100009092', '22-10-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100009092', '22-10-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7', 12, '5', '32', '980', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/xD3bR4M0pgxjNAvPkYK7O5i7KOXp1mTcloZHOfBU.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 0, 550, NULL, NULL, 16, '2277', '2277', 9, 7, '<p><strong>DSR Altitudes</strong> is a premium, high-rise residential project located in Osman Nagar (near Tellapur) in West Hyderabad. Spread across an expansive 7-acre land parcel with 75% open space, it features five 32-story towers offering spacious 3-BHK luxury apartments.</p>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/hm3A1n32No0Fw67yJeNfselt7Jij37h2YwdGoBOu.pdf', '2029-10-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 124, '2026-06-06 07:27:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(122, 'INRA00012226', 154, NULL, 198, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kukatpally Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kukatpally', 'HONER', 'IDL Rd', NULL, 100, '100', '17.4731624', '78.4148242', 'GHMC', 'P02200005923', '01-08-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200005923', '01-08-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '27.5', 12, '18', '25', '3266', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/kP73Ivh0LlB1cUJfOJyqwKFaMtOfyT0TOsMT2CDj.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 8, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1695', '3815', 9, 7, '<p>Come home to Honer Signatis. It is where the rare elements of a modern lifestyle greet you with infinite joy. Woven together with ideas for a perfect life, Signatis is a rare ecosystem where everything comes together in the finest way possible. Every aspect of truly contemporary living finds abode in this discerning project, poised to elevate your life to a level where you deserve to be. Honer Signatis is a gated community apartment project that caters to a wide range of property purchasers and their various family requirements. New buyers can choose 3 BHK apartments between 1695 and 1885 Sft units. Explore elevated 3 and 3.5 BHK apartments ranging in size from 2160 to 2875 sqft if you\'re looking for an upgrade. Growing families will also find large Ultra-Premium 4 BHKs - 3815 Sft homes that are ideal for evolving lifestyles.</p>', NULL, '150', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/lTCFj3sE8Nif5uv6ZvQbZBT3qdJ1u7jFn2mue3Sp.pdf', '2029-02-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 100, '2026-06-06 07:32:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', 20, 5, NULL, 'MDO100P122DFG', NULL),
(124, 'INRA00012426', 162, NULL, 202, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kokapet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kokapet', NULL, NULL, NULL, 124, '124', '17.4057122', '78.3231619', 'HMDA', 'P02400005583', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400005583', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3', 12, '2', '36', '282', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/113EDY1E2OfxNkZnceRXMPghwFJdarnhBbqBtNdP.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 6, 1500, NULL, NULL, 16, '3242', '4090', 9, 7, '<p><strong>DSR Valar</strong> is an ultra-luxury residential high-rise in Kokapet, Hyderabad. Situated on a 3-acre parcel, it features two 36-story towers housing exclusive 4-BHK \"Quadrant Homes\" (only 4 apartments per floor). These corner units offer panoramic city views, expansive layouts, and top-tier amenities</p><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Next to ORR Exit 1, Kokapet, Hyderabad</li><li><strong>Unit Sizes:</strong> 4-BHK configurations ranging from 3,242 to 4,090 sq. ft. super built-up area</li><li><strong>Structure:</strong> Two towers (3 basements + Ground + 36 Floors) comprising 282 total units</li></ul><p><strong>Amenities</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Lifestyle:</strong> Grand clubhouse, infinity swimming pool, and landscaped green areas</li><li><strong>Sports:</strong> Gymnasium, half basketball court, cricket pitch, and fitness/yoga zones</li><li><strong>Convenience:</strong> Dedicated creche/daycare facility, 3-tier security, and pet-friendly spaces</li></ul>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/EqBFV2PYruOSQBOuITqxjyliqsNlzpkUIbiVCvPP.pdf', '2027-08-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 124, '2026-06-06 09:48:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(125, 'INRA00012526', 161, NULL, 201, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Tukkuguda Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tukkuguda', 'Mankhal', 'sy 196', NULL, 100, '100', '17.2135098', '78.4730931', 'HMDA', 'P02400005619', NULL, NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400005619', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5', 12, '5', '9', '288', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/hsgjcShLMfOBJnPLLOvzKABXDUiEPxL8Vy71ETo3.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 8, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1112', '1825', 9, 7, '<p>Residential project, Arkala Life in Hyderabad is offering units for sale in Tukkuguda. Check out some Apartment that suit your lifestyle and liking. Possession date of Arkala Life is Aug, 2025. The property offers 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK units. As per the area plan, units are in the size range of 1130.0 - 1837.0 sq.ft.. The project by Arkala Realty and Infrastructure Private Limited is set in 5 Acres . There are 5 buildings in this project. Contact for further details. Arkala Life is located in Tukkuguda.<br><br>In terms of facilities, Arkala Life is loaded with multiple offerings such as Gymnasium, Power Backup. For families with kids, there is Children\'s Play Area, Kid\'s Pool, nearby apart from Swimming Pool. It is a Gated Community. Immerse yourself in a world of sports with provisions for Cricket Pitch, Skating Rink, Basketball Court, Badminton Court, Cycling &amp; Jogging Track. Residents can make use of ATM, Barbecue Area, Library, Conference Room, provisions in the project. The property has Fire Sprinklers. There is 24x7 Security. There is provision for Visitor Parking.</p>', NULL, '200', '200', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/Yh4lBa5OcNvocSGOk4FVrOMK91FmljcPpgSme9gB.pdf', '2028-09-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 100, '2026-06-06 10:04:28', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', 20, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(126, 'INRA00012626', 163, NULL, 203, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Miyapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Miyapur', 'Miyapur', 'Miyapur', NULL, 134, '134', '17.5131456', '78.3539844', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400008769', '01-01-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3', 12, '3', '12', '270', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/0BtgqcAxvkWNdaypDRWPZ0F07VgdqpCIulwFJs1U.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 15, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1348', '2115', 9, 7, '<h2>Pavani Starlit - Luxury 2BHK &amp; 3BHK\'S at Miyapur</h2><p>Pavani Starlit is an exclusive gated community located in the rapidly growing area of&nbsp; Hyderabad. This premium low density community designed with modern lifestyles in mind, it features thoughtfully planned homes with spacious layouts and excellent ventilation. Starlit offers a range of lifestyle amenities, including fitness center, landscaped gardens, and leisure zones for all age groups.</p><p>Enjoy living in starlit with comfort and luxury by an impressive clubhouse, ensuring a lifestyle that is both active and tranquil. Under Pavani Starlit’s protection, every night feels safe, every morning feels bright, every moment feels secure. Making it the perfect Place for families looking for space, comfort, and a sophisticated lifestyle.</p><p>Experience the elegance, comfort, and lifestyle that awaits you at Starlit.</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/wJAncKVUd6n0lXktWIWq0UvOI3YauuDESElpJ5VA.pdf', '2029-07-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 134, '2026-06-06 10:15:06', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', 25, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(127, 'INRA00012726', 169, NULL, 206, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Tellapur Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tellapur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 124, '124', '17.4562109', '78.2901322', 'HMDA', '010018/BP/HMDA/2189/SKP/2023', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100007480', '01-01-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '14.7', 12, '8', '42', '1976', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/8XouSGv9KA0lRwTVeI0ORUxGm8QIDfg9CYYKU71p.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 15, 500, NULL, NULL, 16, '1475', '1991', 9, 7, '<p><strong>Aparna Newlands</strong> is a premium high-rise gated community in Tellapur, Hyderabad, spanning 14.7 acres. Featuring 8 towers rising up to 42 floors, it offers 1,976 units of 2.5 and 3 BHK apartments with a unique zigzag layout to maximize ventilation and ensure a \"corner apartment feel\".</p><p><strong>Property Highlights</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Unit Sizes:</strong> Ranging from 1,475 sq. ft. to 1,991 sq. ft.</li><li><strong>Pricing &amp; Status:</strong> Units start from approximately ₹1.3 Cr onwards. It is an under-construction project with possessions slated for 2027 and 2028.</li></ul>', NULL, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/A6O9gLKMRQaU6H80psqYgxYbStNnRD5okvsqqjuR.pdf', '2027-08-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 124, '2026-06-06 11:28:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
