(128, 'INRA00012826', 165, NULL, 204, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kokapet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kokapet', 'kokapet', 'west brook,kokapet', NULL, 138, '138', '17.4061675', '78.3269131', 'GHMC', 'P02200003031', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200003031', '01-01-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7.85', 12, '3', '35', '32', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/yjM7rvS1IpS7uAnSCrDFua4Ov0a5Gia0wdXziRgI.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 10, 10000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1075', '2400', 9, 7, '<p>A life of quality and serenity that your heart always yearns for luxury graced with accessibility and convenience, while living amidst peace and nature. Experience the best of both worlds right near you.</p><p>Welcome to Westbrook. It’s time to change your perspective with our premium 2 &amp; 3 BHK flats for sale in Kokapet.</p>', NULL, '200', '200', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/tzdlaHUYw17mcW73BIYjvznmL8PUuqWfenNUSOt4.pdf', '2026-10-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 138, '2026-06-06 11:41:21', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 'INRA00012926', 168, NULL, 207, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Mokila Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Medchal', 'Maisammaguda', 'Maisammaguda Rd', NULL, 100, '100', '17.5876337', '78.4426747', 'HMDA', '046112/MED/R1/U6/HMDA/2021', '01-03-2022', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200004098', '01-03-2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5.24', 12, '3', '15', '638', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/2qTASjDmdvJybHyeFpIn34tyNmFqqKDg5d2e77LP.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 8, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1100', '1900', 9, 7, '<p>Introducing a seamless integration of luxury, beauty, comfort &amp; connectivity. A place specially created keeping the whole family in mind!<br><br>A collection of 2BHK and 3BHK apartments, meticulously crafted for an extraordinary lifestyle. Strategically located in Gandimaisamma x roads, with close proximity to ORR (Outer ring road) ensuring endless possibilities beyond the city lights.<br><br>Spread across 5.24 acres with an ultra-modern clubhouse of 50,000 sq. ft, here your mundane life is sure to turn into a peaceful living. It is not only vastu-compliant and purposely efficient but is also safety assured, per our principles.<br><br>This green building gated community project offers you an essence of exclusivity reminding you: It\'s your world, tailored to your rhythm.</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/6wVldLGK2Y8dxhkAN8LAGWRj0mnpeZbmSVQfHBoN.pdf', '2027-12-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 100, '2026-06-06 11:47:21', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/06/2026', 25, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(130, 'INRA00013026', 170, NULL, 205, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kompally Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kompally', 'Suchitra Junction', 'Suchitra Junction', NULL, 139, '139', '17.5166439', '78.470545', 'GHMC', NULL, '01-01-2021', NULL, 'RERA', NULL, '01-01-2021', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.65', 12, '3', '9', '144', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/O18ySkqJHaeHUeqga3kwW7uHlYBWv4SDARIbdbNJ.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 15, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '1100', '3150', 9, 6, '<p>Riddhi Pramukh Elegance in Kompally is conveniently and strategically located near Suchitra Junction Kompally. Spread over 2.65 acres of land 2, 3 &amp; 4 BHK flats with 144 ranging from 1135 sq ft – 3150 sq ft.</p><p>The project ensures you have sufficient open space and green cover. The community comes with a range of top-notch amenities right from pools, Indoor Games, outdoor courts, etc to an essentials store and so much more, all within the community. Surrounded by lush greenery and located in a prime spot connected to all necessities and luxuries, Riddhi Pramukh Elegance flats facilitate you with all that is required to lead a Serene and luxurious lifestyle.</p>', NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/o9Fk33bVGF5XQBZf9dvIKxsiUBjUNvAFWrmaJeFs.pdf', '2026-01-01', NULL, '1', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 139, '2026-06-08 07:20:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '08/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
