(142, 'INRA00014226', 181, NULL, 213, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Isnapur Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Isnapur', 'Isnapur', 'Isnapur', NULL, 125, '2', '17.546631', '78.2131398', 'HMDA', '000005/LOLPLG/HMDA2025', '01-01-2025', NULL, 'RERA', 'PO1100009381', '01-01-2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '37', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 391, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/I7gPB4txaKRoziJkn7HBLRnbNKysFF3oxR4CrMBG.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 391, 1500, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '2925', '3420', 9, 7, '<p>Welcome to MyCasa</p><h2>Step into a world where luxury meets tranquility.</h2><p>Bollineni’s MYCASA is an exclusive collection of luxury premium villas designed for those who aspire to the exceptional. Sprawled across a magnificent 37 acres, it’s more than just a home – it’s a vibrant triplex villa community.</p><p><strong>2925 sft</strong> luxury triplex villas with spacious, well-planned layouts.</p><p>Prime location at <strong>Isnapur, Hyderabad</strong>, bang on <strong>Mumbai Highway NH-65</strong> for unmatched connectivity.</p><p><strong>50,000 sft clubhouse</strong> with elite lifestyle facilities and top-notch amenities.</p><h2>Amenities that define your lifestyle</h2><p>Well-designed spaces with multiple lifestyle amenities for every age</p><h3>Live at the centre of growth.</h3><ul><li>Located at Isnapur, directly on Mumbai Highway NH-65.</li><li>Quick access to ORR, industrial hubs and upcoming developments.</li><li>Well-connected to schools, colleges and healthcare facilities.</li><li>Short drive to IT and business corridors for daily commuters.</li><li>High appreciation potential in a fast-growing micro-market.</li></ul>', NULL, '200', '200', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/WnvpEGsi7hTsD7coSNETGKsAwwyoyupTmZGRLE5I.pdf', '2028-01-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 125, '2026-06-10 09:01:48', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-10 09:03:00', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '10/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(143, 'INRA00014326', 182, NULL, 214, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Adibatla Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Adibatla', 'Adibatla', 'Adibatla', NULL, 103, '2', '17.2202054', '78.5518901', 'HMDA', '34/LO/Plg/HMDA/2022', '01-01-2022', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400005578.', '01-01-2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '22.5', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 182, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/yXCTLHlFbDAukfnccLJPi5k9zr6dKtLb9H73pEAO.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 182, 1500, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '4054', '8564', 9, 7, '<p>E-Infra Lacasa Villa is an ultra luxury gated villa community located in the rapidly developing region of Adibatla, Hyderabad. Spread across 22 acres of prime land, the project features 182 meticulously planned triplex villas designed to deliver a refined and elevated lifestyle experience. The villas are crafted with contemporary architecture, spacious layouts, and premium specifications, offering built-up areas ranging from 4,054 Sft to 8,564 Sft.<br><br>Every villa is thoughtfully designed with 100% vastu compliance and includes premium lifestyle features such as multi-purpose halls, home theatre provisions, two-car parking spaces, and advanced smart infrastructure support. The project incorporates underground electricity, DG power backup, pneumatic water supply systems, and modern security solutions including CC cameras and app-enabled surveillance for enhanced convenience and safety.<br><br>Residents can enjoy a luxurious lifestyle with access to a grand 30,000 Sft clubhouse, indoor games, landscaped surroundings, wide internal BT roads, and eco-conscious infrastructure including rainwater harvesting and sewage treatment systems. Combining elegance, comfort, and sustainable living, E-Infra Lacasa Villa offers a premium address for modern families seeking luxury living in Hyderabad.</p>', NULL, '500000', '500000', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/7f5HzH57QQKsLWVkbohe7ktnA4hkk83o2e9XFdre.pdf', '2026-12-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 103, '2026-06-10 11:40:01', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-28 08:27:32', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '10/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(146, 'INRA00014426', 186, NULL, 217, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Tukkuguda Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tukkuguda', 'Tukkuguda', 'Tukkuguda', NULL, 122, '122', '17.2045937', '78.4822113', 'HMDA', '12345', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'PO2200007361', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '27', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 180, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/t6iF0UyxKioIQE3d0ta0BNssehILMDFYP4K7ydSx.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 183, 1500, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '3400', '5400', 9, 7, '<p>From the earth to the cosmos. From the starlit skies above you to the beautiful open courtyard to celebrate every moment of life. We are inspired to bring the courtyard back to life in the contemporary avatar in Constella!</p><p>Constella, named after a constellation of stars, is a villa community that’s different by design. It weaves an age-old concept in the architecture-The Courtyard! Invite the cosmos into homes with the outdoors flowing into the indoors.</p><p>Come home to the extraordinaire! Come home to the courtyards of life! At TUKKUGUDA.</p><p>This beautiful universe, Constella offers you space, companionship, and a magical connection with nature. Designed as a 27-acre gated community of 183 breathtaking villas with the finest infrastructure, Constella promises a global look and feel.</p><p>Topped up with a refreshing perspective, the villas in Constella will be divided into clusters. Every cluster will have a common courtyard in the center. Forge a togetherness forever with the inter-connected and free-flowing design that allows the nature to play in all its elements.</p>', NULL, '200', '200', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/R71E4oBeXbPFwAeCXNLjFQqyHVn6QtTQnWwfCFCy.pdf', '2026-12-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 122, '2026-06-12 10:47:17', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-13 06:55:52', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '12/06/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
