(150, 'INRA00015026', 209, NULL, 223, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Kompally Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kompally', 'Kompally', 'Kompally', NULL, 101, '101', '17.5627698', '78.4577539', 'HMDA', '000999/BP/HMDA/0206/MED/2023', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02200007335', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5', 12, '6', '14', '1167', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/ZzjvOPvlOJU20xyT4blTEK6QGsJr7a7XPla9dyDL.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 60, 1500, NULL, NULL, 16, '1320', '1825', 9, 7, '<h2><strong>Why invest in Bhanodaya Crystal?</strong></h2><h2><strong>Smart Investment Meets Luxurious Living in Kompally’s Prime Location</strong></h2><p><strong>\"Experience luxurious living at Bhanodaya Crystal! Discover 2 &amp; 3 BHK flats nestled in the heart of Gundlapochampally, Kompally, Hyderabad. Immerse yourself in a lifestyle defined by convenience, comfort, and modern design Project Highlights: 9+ Acres Luxurious Gated Community HMDA &amp; RERA Approved Project 100+ Amenities &amp; more....\"</strong></p>', NULL, '200', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/Xr5y6Jr5pf53LMzHU65WIIVDuEsRY2D53iB8EYvX.pdf', '2028-09-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 101, '2026-06-15 10:59:10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '15/06/2026', 25, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(151, 'INRA00015126', 208, NULL, 222, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Neopolis Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Neopolis', 'Neopolis', 'Neopolis', NULL, 121, '121', '17.4040987', '78.3046906', 'HMDA', '011159/BP/HMDA/2925/SKP/2024', '01-01-2024', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400009393', '01-01-2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7.7', 12, '5', '55', '655', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/9kx0Us7WA1rmJ3h8AStG8wdJSEEY0JaiFvsiHcdH.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 50, 2000, NULL, NULL, 16, '5250', '7460', 9, 7, '<h2><strong>Welcome to MSN One</strong></h2><p>MSN One is an ultra-luxurious residential enclave at Neopolis, Kokapet, Hyderabad. This luxury address introduces 5 iconic towers that are a perfect example of modern architectural wonder. These towers feature a wide variety of expansive 4 BHK residences with stunning balconies from which you can take in the city vista and the peaceful Osman Sagar Lake. With a yacht-style clubhouse, multiple rooftop amenities, and a helipad over each tower, the premium amenities include an aqua gymnasium, sky infinity pool, indoor video games zone, sky stargazing deck, terrace party zone, banquet hall, mini-theatre, co-working space, multipurpose sports court, rooftop cinema, etc.</p><p>Located in a rapidly developing suburb of Hyderabad, MSN One is surrounded by many prominent landmarks, such as The Global Edge School, Green Gables International School, Continental Hospitals, Organic Store, DMart, Inorbit Mall, Fly Zone Hyderabad, and GRAVA Business Park. For the daily commute, the convenient travel options include the ORR Service Road, Nehru Outer Ring Road, Mokila Road, Kalimandir Main Road, Raidurg Metro Station (Blue Line), and Nagalapalli Railway Station. Furthermore, the proposed Metro Line 2 will improve connectivity. The Rajiv Gandhi International Airport is just a 26-minute drive away. So, be a part of MNS One in Hyderabad, where you’ll find the peace, comfort, and luxury you\'ve always been looking for.</p>', NULL, '200', '1000', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/LRUAYwNvaMbqDBJmEK8eFdZgkR0xXRAVyIWBT6sh.pdf', '2029-12-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 121, '2026-06-15 11:51:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '15/06/2026', 25, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
