(172, 'INRA00017226', 244, NULL, 235, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Kardanur Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kollur', 'Kollur', 'Kollur', NULL, 166, '2', '17.504265', '78.21982', 'HMDA', '000075/LO/Plg/HMDA/2023', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100006350', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '73', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 324, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/1YkPSAGBvOMnxd7fSVz2YNC5wO78C6eiSpFZiauh.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 342, 1498, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '3735', '4904', 9, 7, '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Evora Villas is a premium residential project nestled in lush greenery, offering luxury 4 &amp; 5 BHK villas for sale in Kollur. Designed to redefine modern living, our exquisitely crafted villas blend thoughtful architecture, spacious interiors, and state-of-the-art amenities, ensuring a perfect balance of comfort, elegance, and functionality.</strong></p><p><strong>Situated in a prime location, Evora Villas provides easy access to key landmarks, top schools, healthcare facilities, and entertainment hubs, making it an excellent choice for families, professionals, and investors. Each villa is designed to enhance natural light, ventilation, and overall well-being. As a sought-after destination for luxury villas for sale in Kollur, Hyderabad, Evora Villas offers a tranquil oasis where sophistication meets smart living—a perfect place to call home or make a high-value investment.</strong></p><p><strong>Evora Villas offers a rare blend of architectural elegance and modern functionality as 4 BHK &amp; 5 BHK Villas in Hyderabad. Nestled in the green and rapidly growing suburb of Kollur, the project caters to discerning families who value privacy, space, and sophistication.</strong></p><p><strong>Crafted by Bhavya Constructions, these villas are not just residences—they are lifestyle upgrades. The 4 BHK &amp; 5 BHK Villas in Kollur come with contemporary layouts, landscaped gardens, and smart home automation, making them a haven for comfort and style. Conveniently located near Mokila, Tellapur, Shankarpally, Velimala, Patancheru, and with easy access to Shamshabad Airport, Evora Villas offers unmatched connectivity in a fast-growing residential corridor.</strong></p><p><strong>Whether you are upgrading your current lifestyle or investing for the future, Evora’s 4 BHK &amp; 5 BHK Villas for sale in Hyderabad provide long-term value, prime connectivity, and elevated living. Choose Evora—where quality meets class.</strong></p>', NULL, '300', '500', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/bvhDWzQr2XSbSm5IxhWJicAlQwLEIb1uPZPZJE2a.pdf', '2029-04-01', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 166, '2026-07-02 09:07:13', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-02 09:23:13', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '02/07/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
