(176, 'INRB00017626', 223, NULL, 197, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available for Rent  in Bachupally Hyderabad', 1, 38, '0', '1', 2, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Bachupally', 'Bachupally', 'Bachupally', NULL, 131, '157', '17.5384158', '78.3589976', 'GHMC', '12345', '01-01-2023', NULL, 'RERA', 'PO2200007361', '01-01-2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2.5', 12, '2', NULL, '549', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/nQAw3e5DRbcTpABVuqNPFLbZq04KyK5Vtl3sWPzl.jpg', 'Sq.ft', 'Y', 1234, 12349, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '0', '0', 9, 6, '<h2><strong>TMSR SKYLER - Perfect blend of convenience and luxury</strong></h2><p>Elevate your lifestyle with SKYLER!</p><p>Nestled in the bustling city of Hyderabad, TMSR SKYLER stands as a true urban oasis, an iconic landmark in the vibrant Bachupally neighborhood. Remarkable SKYLER, stories will redefine premium living in the city.</p><p>Discover our premium offering of High-Rise gated community advantageously located on the bustling 200-feet Bachupally road. Standing at G+32 Floors with unmistakable elevations. Access to International Schools, Hospitals and connectivity to major roads has never been more stress-free.</p><p>Guest rooms, Creche, Aerobics studio and Convenience store are not just amenities; they’re integral components. Each aspect is carefully considered to enhance your overall experience, reflecting our commitment to a well-rounded and convenient lifestyle for the residents.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/WzRyYrinh6bQ3Hbqz4CFQG2YQsaTu4qgzKGshZim.pdf', '2026-01-01', NULL, '6 months', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', 157, '2026-07-06 09:26:04', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '06/07/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
