(180, 'INRA00018026', 249, NULL, 243, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Banjara Hills Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Banjara Hills', NULL, NULL, NULL, 179, '2', '17.4222398', '78.4293986', 'HMDA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400004825', '17-07-2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '14', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 117, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/siW8Bmz8iKQMNGNZCMSgSqAKgRdXCNdBPxfvJKNK.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 4, 250, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '4254', '4264', 9, 6, '<p>Set across 14 acres of verdant expanse, Srivari Meadows is an exclusive community of 117 marvellous villas, meticulously positioned to maximise privacy, natural light, and cross ventilation. At its heart lies a refined clubhouse, serene swimming pool, landscaped jogging trails, and a charming children’s park, all within a leisurely stroll from every residence.</p>', NULL, '13499', '118', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/HhGsFkZVTeX3WTN80Pv6pE9XDWvZibah7xAeoz2y.pdf', '2026-07-17', NULL, '0', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 179, '2026-07-17 06:08:46', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 07:39:14', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '17/07/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(181, 'INRA00018126', 251, NULL, 245, 'Residential Plots Space Is Available  in Shadnagar Hyderabad', 8, 9, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Shadnagar', 'Solipur', NULL, NULL, 185, '2', '17.0391806', '78.2006563', 'DTCP', '0001/LO/3152/2022', NULL, NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400004504', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '30', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/KQ97nQPkiayhiYZ95dkWVXkwaOCarIXW0mvU9mjM.jpg', 'sq.yards', 'Y', 50, 100, NULL, NULL, 16, '150', '375', 0, 6, '<p>Strategically located at Solipur, Siri Sampada’s Sapta Varna is a 30-acre premium gated community with seamless connectivity to Shadnagar and key surrounding locations. Thoughtfully planned and well-developed, the project offers <strong>DTCP &amp; RERA-approved plots</strong>, ideal for building your home while securing value in a high-growth corridor.</p><p>The approved layout, well-planned internal roads, and modern amenities ensure transparency and a seamless living experience. With the Occupancy Certificate in place, the project is fully construction-ready. As Shadnagar rises as a high-growth corridor with strong connectivity to key hubs, and the upcoming Bullet Train through Shamshabad is set to unlock regional land value, these <strong>open plots for sale in Shadnagar</strong> offer compelling long-term investment potential.</p>', NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/SnynGZOwktFo8jO0BLYDoXbKMXenxTHi4dfQD6Vh.pdf', '2025-07-08', NULL, '1', 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 185, '2026-08-08 10:25:33', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08 10:45:20', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '08/08/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 'INRA00018226', 253, NULL, 248, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Mokila Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Mokila', NULL, NULL, NULL, 186, '2', '17.4551243', '78.1315064', 'HMDA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RERA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '22', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 81, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/66Y2ilRF3Rm4tvh2vqW7cezwPBN0BMJAqOBuHPPp.webp', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 0, 0, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '2040', '4320', 9, 8, '<p>Kadamba is Hyderabad’s first fully serviced weekend homes project, designed for effortless escapes from the city.It blends premium living, nature, and hospitality to offer a truly relaxing and hassle-free lifestyle.</p>', NULL, '13,480.39', '13,480.39', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/25VH7cXDHQxncnjr7iSKSMbPTSbmLGLVWh0H1mNU.pdf', '2026-08-28', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 186, '2026-08-28 07:03:00', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-28 07:22:26', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '28/08/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(183, 'INRA00018326', 255, NULL, 247, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Vikarabad Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Vikarabad', NULL, NULL, NULL, 187, '187', '17.3364555', '77.9048268', 'HMDA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RERA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.55', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 170, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/ZCFng7ca7tAtzppKNGS13qgQTikJkqWthFfxU2p8.jpg', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 0, 0, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '2327', '2327', 9, 8, '<p>Approved 6 lane Express Highway from TSPA to Manneguda (200ft Road) - (Bijapur Highway) On Manneguda - Tandur 4 lane Sanction Road 5-minute drive to Vikarabacl 15-minute drive to Anantagiri Hills and Ananta Padmanabha Swamy Templ</p>', NULL, '4,500', '4,500', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/Z4rRc7iLW7HXTxMzoBz0j5QIyb0GtxZOP56keDzE.pdf', '2026-08-29', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 187, '2026-08-29 07:22:25', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '29/08/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(184, 'INRA00018426', 256, NULL, 250, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Habsiguda Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Hayathnagar', NULL, NULL, NULL, 188, '188', '17.3273211', '78.6034902', 'HMDA', '12345', '03-09-2026', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/3Lt1WHM3LNq3hXv4MvL37wuHbYFohautCGna8CTm.jpg', 'RERA', 'P02400003556', '03-09-2026', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/hDWrUDDN4uWxirifEBKk3JHB6pa2szRO2jL7L2zR.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5018', 11, '111', '5', '111', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/8pdCIMWp4UpY9tWrEonq1y4chi2hpK5qedVXJ4mp.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 2, 300, NULL, NULL, 16, '1116', '1521', 9, 8, '<p>Krishna Meridian is a premium 2 &amp; 3 BHK luxury apartment project located at BN Reddy Nagar, Injapur, Hyderabad. The project is spread across approximately 1.015 acres and comprises C+G+5 floors with 111 luxury units. It offers gated community living with amenities including a clubhouse, swimming pool, kids play area, modern gym, shuttle/badminton court, pickleball court, jogging track and advanced security features. The project is HMDA/RERA approved.</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/r6tpkfI918qXgHOpy4Cf0sGRt8rsE6Lt4MMimPZA.pdf', '2026-09-03', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 188, '2026-09-03 09:49:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '03/09/2026', 200, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(185, 'INRA00018526', 257, NULL, 251, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Sadashivpet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Kollur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 28, '2', '17.4657413', '78.2849216', 'HMDA', 'HMDA/06112019', '04-09-2026', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100002796', '04-09-2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '13.6', 12, '3', '3', '517', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/COysYsBFkxZbErArEdZMXMW9uUaXErxX0NBLh3pV.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 200, 400, NULL, NULL, 16, '1260', '2425', 9, 8, '<p>Built with superior engineering standards and premium materials to deliver durability, comfort, and refined living.</p>', NULL, '300', '400', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/rxQqEM4dc6bZVwNQQmsDzTZtDexf2cBzqGyyreUY.pdf', '2026-09-04', NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 28, '2026-09-04 06:26:05', NULL, NULL, '2026-09-05 06:50:32', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '04/09/2026', 200, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(186, 'INRA00018626', 258, NULL, 252, 'Residential Apartment Space Is Available  in Sadashivpet Hyderabad', 8, 23, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Isnapur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 28, '2', '17.4657413', '78.2849216', 'HMDA', '1/10/SKP/…/HMDA/06112019', '04-09-2026', NULL, 'RERA', 'P01100002796', '04-09-2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5', 12, '30', '40', '315', NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/zyqonZTEdkcWsaos9keGUZPd3WBrW3VWgBA88UiM.png', 'sq.ft', 'Y', 2, 5, NULL, NULL, 16, '1260', '2425', 9, 8, '<p>In the beautiful and rapidly developing locale of <strong>Patancheru</strong>, <strong>Signature Fortius</strong> stands tall as a high-end luxury residential gated community with access to ORR (Exit 3) within just 10 minutes.</p><p>Spread across 5 acres, with over 60% open spaces, the project is thoughtfully designed for joyful and vibrant community living.</p><p>Being a 100% Vastu-compliant development, Signature Fortius delivers resort-like comfort, modern convenience, and refined elegance — making it one of the most sought-after luxury residences around Hyderabad today.</p>', NULL, '400', '340', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/eYP07SfM7Ai9S2uwHjr86njaWCcwfuABpPxJ4gAn.pdf', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 28, '2026-09-04 07:25:45', NULL, NULL, '2026-09-05 06:41:01', '169.254.169.126', '169.254.169.126', '04/09/2026', 300, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(187, 'INRA00018726', 259, NULL, 160, 'Residential Villa Space Is Available  in Tukkuguda Hyderabad', 8, 8, '1', '0', 1, 'IN', 'TG', 'HYD', 'Tukkuguda', NULL, NULL, NULL, 28, '28', '17.1891487', '78.4712459', 'HMDA', '013076/L0/HMDA/3528/SMD/2024', '04-09-2026', NULL, 'RERA', 'P02400009757', '04-09-2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '13.6', 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 121, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/zopmLcdM1yx6yzyr8RHjfXJiIZqasErH4GAhWAV8.png', 'sq.ft', 'N', NULL, NULL, 'UnFurnished', NULL, 16, '3000', '3500', 9, 6, '<h2><strong>A Step Above Luxury, A Life Beyond Exclusive</strong></h2><p>In the tranquil and fast-growing locale of <strong>Tukkuguda</strong>, <strong>Signature Nature’s Edge</strong> stands as an exclusive gated community of luxurious 4BHK villas (300 &amp; 350 sq. yds).</p><p>Embraced by nature yet rooted in urban convenience, it’s your private escape every day. With easy access to ORR (Exit 14) and the Srisailam Highway, the project blends serene, nature-inspired living with seamless connectivity.</p><p>Thoughtfully planned and 100% Vastu-compliant, Signature Nature’s Edge offers resort-like comfort and refined living — a truly desirable address near Hyderabad.</p>', NULL, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/terraterri-data/XPedo0LAk8Ma7jsh0xTqXZZJF8pJXeQqaqsSi5F4.pdf', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A', 'A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '6', 28, '2026-09-04 10:54:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, '04/09/2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
