(642, 79, 4, '<p><strong>Praneeth Pranav Daffodils</strong> is a thoughtfully designed residential apartment project located in the peaceful surroundings of Mallampet/Shambhipur, near Praneeth Homes, Hyderabad. Spread across approximately 3.7 acres, this semi-gated community offers a balanced lifestyle with a focus on comfort, convenience, and everyday practicality.</p><p>The project consists of well-planned 2, 2.5, and 3 BHK apartments, designed to maximize natural light, ventilation, and efficient space usage. With three residential blocks and a mid-rise structure, it creates a calm and less crowded living environment compared to high-density developments.</p><p>Daffodils provides essential amenities and basic security, making it ideal for families looking for a peaceful residential setting without the complexity or cost of large gated townships. Its location offers good connectivity to key parts of Hyderabad while still maintaining a quieter neighborhood feel.</p><p>Overall, it’s a practical choice for homebuyers seeking a comfortable home in a growing residential area with reliable infrastructure and a community-oriented environment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'I', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-01 11:46:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
