(792, 95, 5, '<p>Main Door - Hardwood/Engineered wood frame finished with melamine spray polish, teak veneer finish flush shutter with hardware of reputed make.</p><p>Internal Doors - Hardwood/Engineered wood door frame and laminated flush shutter</p><p>Utility Doors - UPVC Door with fixed panel at bottom and glass at top French Doors - UPVC Sliding door with provision for mosquito mesh</p><p>Windows-uPVC windows with MS Grills for specified windows and provision for mesh</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(793, 95, 6, '<p>Living, Dining, Bedroom and Kitchen - Vitrified tiles of reputed make Bathrooms - Antiskid tiles of reputed make Corridors - Naturalstone /Vitrified tiles of reputed make Master Balcony - Antiskid tiles of reputed make Living Balcony - Antiskid tiles of reputed make.</p><p>Bathrooms - Dado up to false ceiling height with ceramic/vitrified tiles of reputed make</p><p>Utility - Antiskid tiles of reputed make for flooring and Dado up to 3\'-O\' height with ceramic / vitrified tiles of reputed make.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(794, 95, 7, '<p>Internal - Smooth Putty finish with 2 coats of premium acrylic emulsion paint of reputed make over a coat of primer</p><p>External - Textured finish and two coats of exterior emulsion paint of reputed make</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(795, 95, 8, '<p>Dado - Dado of 2 ft height above kitchen platform.</p><p>Plumbing - Provision for sink tap and water purifier.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(796, 95, 10, '<p>Power Sockets will be provided for cooking range, chimney, refrigerator, microwave ovens, mixer/grinders, and water purifier.</p><p>*Granite platform and sink not part of specifications.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(797, 95, 9, '<p>Plumbing - Provision for sink tap and water purifier.Bathrooms - All C.P &amp; Sanitary Fittings - Kohler or equivalent make, false ceiling in all bathrooms.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(798, 95, 17, '<p>WTP/STP - Water softening plant will be installed. Sewage Treatment Plant of adequate capacity as per norms will be provided inside the project. Treated sewage water will be used for landscaping and flushing purpose.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(799, 95, 16, '<p>- Entire Parking is well designed to suit the number of car parks with parking signages at required places.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(800, 95, 15, '<p>High speed automatic passenger lifts. One service lift per block</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(801, 95, 20, '<p>Fire Hydrant and Fire Sprinkler system in all the floors and basements. Fire Alarm and Public Address System in all the floors and parking areas (Basements)</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(802, 95, 21, '<p>Supply of gas from centralised gas bank to all individual flats.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(803, 95, 18, '<p>100% D.G backup for common areas and flats.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(804, 95, 19, '<p>Round the clock security surveillance system.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(805, 95, 24, '<p>Lifts - High speed automatic passenger lifts. One service lift per block</p><p>WTP/STP - Water softening plant will be installed. Sewage Treatment Plant of adequate capacity as per norms will be provided inside the project. Treated sewage water will be used for landscaping and flushing purpose.</p><p>EV Charging - Provision for one charging point will be provided in the parking space for each flat.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:33:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(806, 96, 4, '<p>Vision\'s Arsha is built using an advanced RCC shear wall framed structure engineered to withstand seismic and wind loads, ensuring superior strength, stability, and long-term durability. The project incorporates high-quality construction standards with RCC shear walls and concrete blockwork for non-structural elements, delivering a safe, robust, and future-ready living environment.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(807, 96, 5, '<p>The residences feature premium-quality teak veneered main doors, laminated internal doors, UPVC sliding French doors, and UPVC windows with mosquito mesh provisions. Aesthetically designed MS railings and window grills complement the contemporary architecture while enhancing safety, ventilation, and natural lighting</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(808, 96, 6, '<p>Elegant vitrified flooring is provided across living, dining, bedrooms, and kitchen areas, creating a refined and sophisticated ambiance. Corridors feature vitrified tiles with granite inlays, while balconies are finished with wooden-texture vitrified tiles, combining durability with modern aesthetics.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(809, 96, 7, '<p>The project features premium-quality finishes with textured exterior emulsion paint and smooth putty-finished interiors coated with high-grade acrylic emulsion. These finishes enhance the visual appeal of the residences while ensuring long-lasting protection and easy maintenance.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(810, 96, 8, '<p>Designed for functionality and convenience, the kitchens come with provisions for municipal water supply, water purifiers, exhaust fans, and chimneys. The layout is optimized to provide an efficient cooking space that complements modern lifestyles.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(811, 96, 9, '<p>Bathrooms are equipped with premium sanitary ware, wall-mounted EWC systems, quality CP fittings, shower provisions, and PVC false ceilings. The thoughtfully designed spaces combine comfort, functionality, and contemporary aesthetics.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(812, 96, 10, '<p>Each apartment is equipped with concealed copper wiring, premium switches, three-phase power supply, individual prepaid meters, and provisions for air conditioning, television, internet, and modern appliances. The electrical infrastructure is designed to support a seamless and comfortable living experience.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(813, 96, 15, '<p>Every tower is served by multiple high-speed automatic passenger elevators along with a dedicated passenger-cum-service lift. Equipped with rescue devices, energy-efficient systems, CCTV surveillance, and premium lift lobbies, the vertical transportation system ensures convenience and safety for residents.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(814, 96, 16, '<p>The project offers well-planned basement-level parking across multiple levels, with dedicated EV charging provisions and car washing facilities. The parking design ensures smooth circulation, convenience, and future-ready infrastructure for residents.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(815, 96, 17, '<p>Vision\'s Arsha incorporates sustainable water management systems including a water softening plant, sewage treatment plant, and rainwater harvesting facilities. Treated water is reused for landscaping and flushing, promoting environmental responsibility and efficient resource utilization.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(816, 96, 18, '<p>To ensure uninterrupted comfort, the project provides 100% power backup through DG sets with acoustic enclosures and automatic mains failure systems, guaranteeing reliable electricity supply during outages.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(817, 96, 19, '<p>A comprehensive security ecosystem featuring round-the-clock surveillance, CCTV monitoring, intercom connectivity, panic buttons in lifts, and solar-powered perimeter fencing ensures a secure and peaceful living environment for residents.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(818, 96, 20, '<p>The project is equipped with advanced fire safety measures including fire hydrants, sprinkler systems, fire alarms, and public address systems across residential towers and parking areas, ensuring adherence to modern safety standards.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(819, 96, 21, '<p>A centralized LPG gas supply system is provided for all apartments, offering enhanced convenience, safety, and efficient energy distribution throughout the community.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(820, 96, 24, '<p>Vision\'s Arsha integrates eco-friendly initiatives such as solar power for common areas, solar hot water systems for select residences, rainwater harvesting, and energy-efficient infrastructure, promoting a sustainable and environmentally conscious lifestyle.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 06:38:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(821, 97, 4, '<ul><li>RCC framed structure designed as per seismic standards.</li><li>Reinforced concrete foundations, columns, beams and slabs.</li><li>Solid/AAC block masonry for external and internal walls.</li><li>Earthquake-resistant structural design.</li><li>Durable construction using premium-grade materials.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(822, 97, 5, '<ul><li>Main Door: Engineered hardwood frame with teak finish designer shutter.</li><li>Internal Doors: Flush doors with premium laminate finish.</li><li>Toilet Doors: Waterproof flush doors.</li><li>UPVC sliding windows with mosquito mesh provision.</li><li>Toughened glass and premium hardware fittings.</li><li>Balcony doors with powder-coated aluminum/UPVC sections.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(823, 97, 6, '<ul><li>Main Door: Engineered hardwood frame with teak finish designer shutter.</li><li>Internal Doors: Flush doors with premium laminate finish.</li><li>Toilet Doors: Waterproof flush doors.</li><li>UPVC sliding windows with mosquito mesh provision.</li><li>Toughened glass and premium hardware fittings.</li><li>Balcony doors with powder-coated aluminum/UPVC sections.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(824, 97, 7, '<ul><li>Premium emulsion paint for internal walls.</li><li>Weather-resistant exterior texture paint.</li><li>Enamel paint for grills and metal surfaces.</li><li>Smooth putty finish before painting.</li><li>Long-lasting UV-resistant exterior coating.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(825, 97, 8, '<ul><li>Granite platform with stainless steel sink.</li><li>Provision for water purifier.</li><li>Glazed ceramic tile dado above counter.</li><li>Utility area with washing machine provision.</li><li>Provision for exhaust fan and chimney.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(826, 97, 9, '<ul><li>Premium quality sanitary ware.</li><li>CP fittings from reputed brands.</li><li>Anti-skid ceramic flooring.</li><li>Wall-mounted EWC in all toilets.</li><li>Hot and cold water mixer provisions.</li><li>Exhaust fan provision.</li><li>Geyser point in bathrooms.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(827, 97, 10, '<ul><li>Concealed copper wiring.</li><li>Modular switches.</li><li>Adequate power outlets in all rooms.</li><li>AC points in bedrooms and living areas.</li><li>TV and internet points.</li><li>MCB and ELCB protection system.</li><li>Provision for inverter connection.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(828, 97, 15, '<ul><li>High-speed automatic passenger elevators.</li><li>Separate service/goods lift where applicable.</li><li>Generator backup for elevator operation.</li><li>Branded lifts with safety systems.</li><li>Emergency alarm and communication facility.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `project_listing_specifications_mapping` (`id`, `project_listing_id`, `specifications_id`, `description`, `mapping_status`, `created_by_type`, `created_by`, `created_date`, `updated_by_type`, `updated_by`, `updated_date`, `created_ip`, `updated_ip`, `new_column`) VALUES
(829, 97, 16, '<ul><li>Three-level parking facility.</li><li>Two dedicated car parking slots per apartment.</li><li>Well-marked parking bays.</li><li>Visitor parking provision.</li><li>Easy vehicle circulation and access control.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(830, 97, 17, '<ul><li>Treated municipal and borewell water supply.</li><li>Underground and overhead water storage tanks.</li><li>Sewage Treatment Plant (STP).</li><li>Recycled water for landscaping and flushing.</li><li>Efficient water management system.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(831, 97, 18, '<ul><li>100% power backup for common areas.</li><li>Generator backup for lifts and essential services.</li><li>Backup provision for apartments as per builder specifications.</li><li>Automatic power changeover system.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(832, 97, 19, '<ul><li>24x7 professional security personnel.</li><li>CCTV surveillance in common areas.</li><li>Intercom connectivity.</li><li>Visitor management system.</li><li>Controlled access at entry and exit points.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(833, 97, 20, '<ul><li>Fire-fighting system as per statutory norms.</li><li>Fire hydrants and hose reels.</li><li>Smoke detectors in common areas.</li><li>Fire extinguishers at designated locations.</li><li>Emergency evacuation provisions.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(834, 97, 21, '<ul><li>Centralized LPG supply provision.</li><li>Safety-compliant gas distribution system.</li><li>Individual metering provisions.</li><li>Leak detection and safety mechanisms.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(835, 97, 24, '<p>uodsjhdfsj</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:52:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(836, 98, 4, '<p>The project is constructed as an RCC framed structure with external walls built using solid or AAC blocks.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(837, 98, 5, '<p>The residences feature main doors with seasoned African teak wood frames and particle board flush shutters finished with veneer and PU polish on both sides, hardwood frames with laminated or pigmented flush shutters for internal and toilet openings, and single-glazed UPVC windows and French sliding doors fitted with a mosquito mesh system.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(838, 98, 6, '<p>The living, dining, kitchen, and bedroom areas are finished with glazed vitrified tiles of an approved brand or make, while balconies feature vitrified tiles with a spacer joint, and staircases use natural or tandoor stone or precast concrete tiles.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(839, 98, 7, '<p>Internal walls are treated with basic putty, Gyproc, or cement-based putty followed by premium plastic emulsion paint of approved shades, while external walls are finished with an weather-proof coat or texture paint from brands like Asian Paints or Dulux.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(840, 98, 8, '<p>The units provide provisions for a kitchen counter, necessary water supply, and electrical connections for appliances like a chimney, refrigerator, microwave, and RO unit.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(841, 98, 9, '<p>Each bathroom is equipped with a washbasin, an EWC of a reputed make, a single-lever fixture with a CP diverter and overhead shower, and vitrified or ceramic wall dadoing up to a height of 2250mm alongside anti-skid floor tiles.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(842, 98, 10, '<p>The electrical infrastructure provides a three-phase power supply to each unit with dual individual prepaid metering, miniature circuit breakers (MCBs) for distribution boards, designer modular switches, and designated power points for kitchen appliances, washing machines, and air conditioning units.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(843, 98, 15, '<p>The high-rise community is serviced by a total of eight high-speed automatic passenger lifts of a reputed make featuring emergency rescue devices, CC camera provisions inside the cabins, and dedicated fire and service lift units</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(844, 98, 16, '<p>Each individual apartment is allocated at least one dedicated car parking space, with option to purchase extra car parking slots across the project\'s four distinct parking levels.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(845, 98, 17, '<p>The property features fully treated water distributed via a centralized water softening and purification plant, alongside an adequately sized Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) that recycles treated water for landscape and flushing purposes.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(846, 98, 18, '<p>The project provides 100% DG backup for all common and residential areas to ensure an uninterrupted electricity supply.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(847, 98, 19, '<p>Round-the-clock protection is managed via a sophisticated security network that includes RFID tag automated access control at the main gate, boom barriers, and a comprehensive 24-hour network of CC cameras positioned across key locations in the community.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(848, 98, 20, '<p>The complex is equipped with automated fire alarm systems, safety sprinklers in all areas, and wet risers as per statutory requirements from the Fire Service Department.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(849, 98, 21, '<p>Residents are serviced by an integrated LPG reticulation system that delivers a safe piped gas supply to individual units measured via prepaid or postpaid billing meters.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(850, 98, 24, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 08:56:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(851, 99, 4, '<p>RCC framed structure on footing over hard strata by using TMT and Ultratech or equivalent cement 53 Grade, pest control, soil testing to be done as per standards. Structural Design<br>The structural designs are conforming to IS standards of earth quake resistant structures.<br>Super Structure<br>First class solid brick work in cement mortar(1:6). External walls with 8 inches and internal walls with 4 1⁄2 inches as per Architectural design.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:06', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(852, 99, 5, '<p>Main Door</p><p>7’6” Height engineered/hard wood frame finished with melamine spray finish, veneered flush shutters with reputed hardware.</p><p>Internal Doors</p><p>Engineered / Hard wood door frame &amp; veneered shutter and hardware of reputed make.<br>Utility / Bathroom Doors</p><p>Engineered / Hard wood door frame &amp; one side veneered and other side PU/Laminated shutter and hardware of reputed make.</p><p>French Doors</p><p>uPVC door frames with float glass panelled sliding shutters with mosquito mesh.<br>Windows<br>uPVC window glazing system with sliding/casement shutters with mosquito mesh.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(853, 99, 6, '<p>All Living &amp; Dining</p><p>800mm x 800 mm size double charged vitrified tiles of reputed make<br>All Bedrooms &amp; Kitchen<br>800mm x 800mm size double charged vitrified tiles of reputed make</p><p>All Balconies</p><p>600mm x 600mm Anti-skid ceramic tiles of reputed make<br>Bathrooms<br>Acid resistant, 600mm X 300mm anti-skid ceramic tiles of reputed make</p><p>Utility</p><p>600mm X 300mm anti-skid GVT tiles of reputed make<br>Corridors<br>Vitrified tiles of reputed make</p><p>Staircase</p><p>Kota stone/Natural stone/Grani</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(854, 99, 7, '<p>Internal Walls</p><p>Smooth putty finish with 2 coats of premium Acrylic emulsion paint of reputed make over a coat of primer. External Walls</p><p>Textured finish and two coats of exterior emulsion paint of reputed make.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(855, 99, 8, '<p>Separate Municipal water tap (Manjeera or any other water provided by GHMC along with bore well water)<br>Provision for fixing of water purifier, exhaust fan, chimney and HOB.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(856, 99, 9, '<p>Premium quality ceramic washbasins of Hindware or equivalent.<br>Premium quality wall mounted EWC of Hindware or equivalent.</p><p>Premium quality concealed flush tank of Gabrette or equivalent brand<br>Premium quality single lever crome plated C.P fittings of Grohe/Jaquar or equivalent. Metered water supply to all flats</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(857, 99, 10, '<p>Power outlets for air-conditioners in living, dining and bedrooms.<br>Power plug for Hob, chimney, refrigerator, microwave oven, mixer / grinder in kitchen, washing machine / dishwasher in Utility area</p><p>Three-phase supply for each unit and individual prepaid meter.<br>Miniature Circuit Breakers (MCB) for each distribution board of reputed make Modular switches of Legrand / Schneider or equivalent</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(858, 99, 15, '<p>High speed automatic elevators per block of Schindler/Mitsubishi or equivalent make with rescue device and with V3F for energy efficiency with granite / tile cladding for lift entrance.</p><p>Service elevators for each block of Schindler/Mitsubishi or equivalent make with rescue device and with V3F for energy efficiency, entrance with granite / tile cladding on lift entrance.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(859, 99, 16, '<p>Spacious car parking slots</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(860, 99, 17, '<p><strong>WTP &amp; STP</strong></p><p>Fully treated water will be made available through an exclusive water softening plant.<br>Hydro-pneumatic system for even pressure water supply at all floors.</p><p>A sewage treatment plant of adequate capacity inside the project, treated sewage water will be used for landscaping and flushing purpose.</p><p>Rain water harvesting at regular intervals provided for recharging ground water levels</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(861, 99, 20, '<p>Fire hydrant and fire sprinkler system in all floors and basements.<br>Fire alarm and public address system in all floors and basements.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(862, 99, 18, '<p>100 % D.G backup with Acoustic enclosure</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(863, 99, 19, '<p><strong>SECURITY / BMS</strong></p><p>Sophisticated round-the-clock security / Surveillance system.<br>BMS will be provided (Centralized billing) Surveillance cameras at the main Security and entrance of each block to monitor and also provided with CCTV cameras inside the lifts</p><p>Panic button and intercom in the lifts connected to the Security room.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(864, 99, 21, '<p>Supply of LPG/ PNG with piped gas system with individual pre-paid meter</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(865, 99, 24, '<p><strong>EV CHARGING SYSTEM</strong></p><p>Provision for EV charging for cars at extra cost</p><p><strong>BILLING SYSTEM</strong></p><p>Automated billing system for water, power &amp; LPG/CNG supply.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 09:30:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(866, 100, 8, '<p>Two coats of premium acrylic low VOC emulsion paint over<br>a coat of acrylic primer with a smooth putty finish<br>(two coats putty, one coat primer, two coats paint)<br>Optional: Dado up to ceiling height using vitrified tiles for better<br>compatibility with modular kitchen equipment.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(867, 100, 4, '<p>RCC Shear Wall Structural System, designed to withstand<br>wind and seismic loads as per relevant IS Codes.Reinforced shear walls / cement concrete blocks as per<br>design / requirement.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(868, 100, 5, '<p>Premium quality tile / natural stone / any other material<br>cladding as per design.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(869, 100, 6, '<p>Matte finish full body vitrified tiles.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(870, 100, 7, '<p>Two coats of acrylic exterior emulsion paint with texture finish as per design.Two coats of premium acrylic low VOC emulsion paint over a<br>coat of acrylic primer with a smooth putty finish (two coats<br>putty, one coat primer, two coats paint).</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(871, 100, 9, '<p>Engineered wood / hard wood door frame with one side<br>veneer and the other side with laminate flush shutter with<br>hardware of reputed make.<br>Toilet &amp; Utility Doors: 8\'x 26\"<br>Wide Toilet Door: 8\' x 3\' in one bedroom other than the<br>master bedroom for improved wheel chair access.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(872, 100, 10, '<p>Modular switches of premium make.<br>MCB of a reputed make for distribution boards in each unit.<br>One earth leakage circuit breaker for each unit / flat.<br>Adequate power points for unit area as per electrical design.<br>Three-phase supply in each unit, with individual prepaid meters.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(873, 100, 15, '<p>6 high speed automatic passenger lifts of reputed make<br>in each tower, with rescue device, V3F for energy efficiency.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(874, 100, 16, '<p>Pre-allotted covered car parking space across 4 levels<br>of basements with adequate visitor\'s car parks with parking<br>signage and equipment as per parking and traffic safety plan.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(875, 100, 17, '<p>The project is equipped with a centralized water supply system supported by both borewells and municipal sources, ensuring uninterrupted availability across all units through a hydro-pneumatic distribution system. It also features a modern sewage treatment plant (STP) with adequate capacity, where treated water is efficiently reused for flushing, landscaping, and maintenance purposes, along with integrated rainwater harvesting systems to support groundwater recharge and sustainable water management.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(876, 100, 18, '<p>100% power backup is provided for common areas and essential services, with backup supply for apartments to ensure uninterrupted living.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(877, 100, 19, '<p>The project features a gated community setup with 24/7 security, CCTV surveillance, and controlled access for enhanced safety of residents.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(878, 100, 20, '<p>Fire safety systems are installed as per norms, including fire extinguishers, alarms, and sprinkler systems ensuring maximum safety.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(879, 100, 21, '<p>Centralized LPG gas pipeline system is provided with individual meters and safety measures for efficient and safe usage.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(880, 100, 24, '<p>SDECSC</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:09:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(881, 101, 4, '<p>Built with an RCC framed structure designed to comply with IS Codes and Zone II seismic regulations, using fly ash or porotherm bricks for the walls</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(882, 101, 5, '<p>Main and internal doors use MS frames from Shakthi Hormann (or equivalent), while the windows and French doors feature UPVC framing with float glass.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(883, 101, 6, '<p>Main living areas and bedrooms feature $600 \\times 600\\text{ mm}$ vitrified tiles, the staircase is finished in marble, granite, or stepper tiles, and the balconies, toilets, and utility areas utilize anti-skid ceramic tiling</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(884, 101, 7, '<p>Finished with luppam and emulsion paint on the inside, and a combination of exterior emulsion, texture, and appropriate cladding on the outside.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(885, 101, 8, '<p>Includes a 25-square-foot granite platform with a stainless steel sink, ceramic wall tiles up to 18 inches above the counter, and dedicated electrical points for kitchen appliances.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(886, 101, 9, '<p>Equipped with floor-mounted Cera (or equivalent) sanitary fittings, Jaguar Esco (or equivalent) taps, hot and cold water mixers, and a common geyser provision</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(887, 101, 10, '<p>Formed with 3-phase power supply and copper wiring, using Great White (or equivalent) switches and MCBs, with dedicated AC points in the bedrooms</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(888, 101, 15, '<p>Standardized with high-speed lifts.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(889, 101, 16, '<p>Features robust VDF (Vacuum Dewatered Flooring) or specialized parking tiles.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(890, 101, 17, '<p>Outfitted with a complete water supply system involving overhead domestic tanks and integrated Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) facilities</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(891, 101, 18, '<p>Supported by standard soundproof generators providing full power backup for all lights and fans.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(892, 101, 19, '<p>Monitored around the clock with security CCTV cameras throughout the project and solar fencing along the boundary walls</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(893, 101, 20, '<p>Covered under the comprehensive miscellaneous design and layout provisions engineered by the architectural consultants for the safety and infrastructure of the units.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(894, 101, 21, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(895, 101, 24, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 10:37:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(896, 103, 4, '<p>RCC Foundation</p><p>Super structure with Aluminum form work shear wall technology</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 11:19:10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(897, 103, 7, '<ol><li>﻿﻿﻿External: Textured finish and 2 coats of external emulsion paint<br>Asian/Berger</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Internal: All internal walls with base paint and POP punning/ Gyproc<br>Painting with premium quality, Acrylic emulsion paint brands like Asian/Berger</li></ol>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 11:19:10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(898, 103, 5, '<ol><li>﻿﻿﻿Main Door: High-end engineered wood door frame &amp; shutter with premium finish and hardware. Architrave in door frame</li><li>﻿﻿﻿High-end engineered wood door frame &amp; shutter with premium finish and hardware.</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Utility Doors: Aluminum door frame of reputed profile section</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Windows/French<br>Doors: UPVC/Powder coated aluminum window systems with fibre mesh, designed to take all wind pressure double glazed unit with toughened glass or equivalent glass up to slab level, with two track/ three track sliding</li></ol>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 11:19:10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(899, 103, 6, '<ol><li>﻿﻿﻿Living/Dining: Italian marble (Rs. 300 per sft.)</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Utility/Balcony: Italian shade</li></ol><p>vitrinea tiles</p><ol><li>﻿﻿﻿M.Bed Room/Bed Room:<br>Italian shade vitrified tiles</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Kitchen/Toilets: Italian shade vitrified tiles</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Staircase: Granite</li><li>﻿﻿﻿Parking/Driveways: Combination of VDF Flooring/Interlocking</li></ol>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-03 11:19:10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
