(972, 108, 5, '<p>Features meticulously designed, durable main and internal doors paired with premium sliding window systems engineered to maximize natural daylight, structural safety, and seamless balcony transitions</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(973, 108, 6, '<p>Finished with high-end, heavy-duty floor materials tailored for a modern 3BHK layout, combining sophisticated aesthetics in the living zones with functional, anti-skid surfaces in utility areas</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(974, 108, 7, '<p>Coated with premium-grade internal emulsions and weather-resistant external paints selected under the project’s durability principles to ensure minimal long-term maintenance and a lasting, nature-inspired visual appeal.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(975, 108, 8, '<p>Designed around pragmatic functionality, offering an ergonomic layout with intelligent space provisions for modern culinary appliances, heavy-duty utilities, and effortless everyday cooking.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(976, 108, 9, '<p>Outfitted with a senior-citizen accessible blueprint featuring high-quality, water-efficient plumbing fixtures, premium sanitary ware, and sensible layout transitions focused on safety and comfort.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(977, 108, 10, '<p>Engineered with safe, concealed copper wiring, strategic point allocations for automated appliances, high-speed internet connectivity, and independent power routing designed to fit a smart urban lifestyle</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(978, 108, 15, '<p>Equipped with high-speed, smart passenger elevators inside each tower block alongside dedicated service lifts to provide safe, reliable vertical transit across all 12 residential floors.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(979, 108, 16, '<p>Features an expansive, double-height stilt parking level thoughtfully mapped for easy vehicular movement, secure parking slots, and hassle-free, barrier-free access for senior citizens.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(980, 108, 17, '<p>Incorporates advanced, low-maintenance eco-infrastructure including a dedicated Water Softening Plant for purified domestic supply and an on-site Sewage Treatment Plant to efficiently recycle wastewater for community landscaping</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(981, 108, 18, '<p>Backed by a 100% heavy-duty generator system engineered to automatically maintain uninterrupted power supply for individual homes, essential shared utilities, elevators, and peripheral safety grids.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(982, 108, 19, '<p>Managed by a continuous, multi-tiered security system featuring controlled gate checkpoints, smart visitor monitoring, and comprehensive CCTV surveillance across all public and residential zones.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(983, 108, 20, '<p>Built in strict compliance with premium statutory norms, integrating automated fire sprinklers, smoke detectors, alarms, and easily accessible fire hydrants throughout all towers and stilt areas.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(984, 108, 21, '<p>Outfitted with a secure, centralized piped gas network delivering safe, hassle-free cooking gas directly to every kitchen through an independently metered distribution line.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(985, 108, 24, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 10:12:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(986, 109, 4, '<p>Built across a 9.45-acre self-sustained township featuring 4 blocks of 15 storeys each. The buildings feature a single-coat internal plaster and a double-coat external plaster finish</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(987, 109, 5, '<p>Main entryways are fitted with high-quality laminated flush doors, while internal rooms feature standard flush doors. Windows are well-engineered, designer ALU windows built from branded sections</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(988, 109, 6, '<p>Standardized with premium vitrified tile flooring stretching across all individual rooms and the kitchen area. Main entrances and common zones feature a well-designed lift lobby and foyer flooring layout.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(989, 109, 7, '<p>Finished cleanly with smooth putty on the inside walls and covered with durable, waterproof external cement or acrylic paint on the outside.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(990, 109, 8, '<p>Built with a sturdy marble or granite kitchen platform, an integrated branded stainless steel sink, a dedicated piped gas connection, and protective wall dado tiles reaching up to 2 feet.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(991, 109, 9, '<p>Finished with glazed or ceramic wall tiles up to a height of 7 feet, utilizing branded sanitary ware and premium C.P. (Chrome Plated) fittings</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(992, 109, 10, '<p>Configured with completely concealed safety wiring, an adequate number of points, premium ISI-marked modular switches, and dedicated internal points for an AC unit, TV, and a washing machine.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(993, 109, 15, '<p>Each individual residential tower is equipped with branded passenger lifts that open up into beautifully designed, elegant lift lobbies.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(994, 109, 16, '<p>Planned with ample vehicle parking layouts including specialized designated parking slots for visitors.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(995, 109, 17, '<p>Supported by an engineered 24-hour continuous water supply system alongside a self-sustained township layout planned with essential utility infrastructure.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(996, 109, 18, '<p>Common areas, facilities, and essential services are fully backed up by standard power layouts.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(997, 109, 19, '<p>Kept safe and secure inside a fully gated community operating continuous CCTV surveillance, reinforced with an intercom facility inside the apartments.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(998, 109, 20, '<p>Maintained in strict compliance with National Building Code (NBC) safety norms, featuring functional fire-fighting systems installed throughout all common areas and basement levels.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(999, 109, 21, '<p>Outfitted with modern, safe piped gas connection lines pre-installed directly into the kitchen spaces</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1000, 109, 24, '<p>,</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-04 11:22:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1001, 110, 4, '<p>A monumental high-rise gateway development spanning a massive <strong>14-acre premises</strong>, featuring <strong>7 towers</strong> engineered up to <strong>40 floors</strong> high. Each tower is anchored by a double-height entrance lobby and an integrated underground road network with individual tower access ramps, completely eliminating vehicle congestion at the ground level</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1002, 110, 5, '<p>Designed with standard architectural engineering layout configurations to ensure that all 3 BHK and 4 BHK residential entrances harmonize with the floor space. The exterior window and balcony framing systems are structurally positioned to maximize cross-ventilation and take advantage of expansive outdoor scenic views</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1003, 110, 6, '<p>Finished using high-durability, premium floor materials suited to larger-format luxury layouts. The material specifications provide high structural load limits to support vast layouts ranging from <strong>1,400 SFT up to 3,950 SFT</strong>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1004, 110, 7, '<p>Coated with long-lasting premium weather-shielding exterior elements and smooth internal wall treatments, framing the visual silhouette of the community adjacent to the 8-Lane Outer Ring Road.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1005, 110, 8, '<p>An intelligently optimized utility and service zone featuring an attached, well-proportioned utility balcony space. The blueprint easily integrates modern heavy appliances, gas lines, and high-efficiency workflow layouts tailored for premium family dining.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1006, 110, 9, '<p>Outfitted with high-end, branded sanitary fixtures and sleek CP fittings. The technical layout incorporates designated plumbing for master and common attached toilets, keeping independent wet and dry areas efficiently separated.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1007, 110, 10, '<p>Engineered with heavy-load concealed internal circuitry, backup generator switches, and multiple points for split ACs and data ports. The shared infrastructure extends out to the ground levels with built-in <strong>EV charging provisions for cabs and personal vehicles</strong>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1008, 110, 15, '<p>Equipped with a collection of high-speed passenger elevators and dedicated service/freight lifts operating reliably across all 40 storeys, integrated directly with tower entrance lobbies and basement parking decks.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1009, 110, 16, '<p>Features a massive, dedicated <strong>7-level car parking</strong> infrastructure designed to comfortably absorb the vehicular footprint of the <strong>2,600 apartments</strong> across the premises.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1010, 110, 17, '<p>Managed by large-scale eco-utilities including a <strong>24-hour treated water supply plant</strong> and an advanced Sewage Treatment Plant designed to recycle wastewater cleanly for the expansive landscaping and estate preservation.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1011, 110, 18, '<p>Supported by a fully continuous emergency power infrastructure providing uncompromised 100% electrical backup for residential common areas, internal elevators, high-capacity water pumps, and critical apartment safety networks</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1012, 110, 19, '<p>Enforced via a <strong>24-hour professional and electronic security system</strong> featuring continuous CCTV monitoring, guard checkpoints at entrance canopies, and strict visitor verification tracking.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1013, 110, 20, '<p>Engineered in accordance with international high-rise safety protocols, utilizing internal fire escape design frameworks, automated alarms, fire hydrants, and a layout that allows clear access paths for emergency response teams around the perimeter</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1014, 110, 21, '<p>Supplied through a secure, property-wide centralized piped gas system distribution network that safely serves every individual apartment cluster under multi-layered gas monitoring and isolation valves</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1015, 110, 24, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:37:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1016, 111, 4, '<p>SUPER STRUCTURE<br>R.C.C. Shear wall framed structure to<br>withstand wind &amp; seismic loads.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1017, 111, 5, '<p>3.3 m height from slab to slab.Reinforced shear walls as per structural design.Brick walls as per structural design</p><p>Windows: Anodized aluminium frame with provision for mosquito mesh.French doors: Anodized aluminium frame.Ventilators/Windows: UPVC/Aluminium ventilators for all toilets and staff/driver areas.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1018, 111, 6, '<p>Living, Dining, Drawing, Pooja, Kitchen &amp; Bedrooms: Large-size premium GVT flooring with 3\" skirting.</p><p>Toilets: Acid-resistant and anti-skid premium vitrified tiles with wall cladding up to door height.</p><p>Corridors: Marble/GVT/Granite or equivalent as per architect design.</p><p>Living balconies/sit-outs: Tiles/Granite as per architect design.</p><p>Clubhouse: Combination of Marble and GVT.</p><p>Passenger Staircase: Granite or equivalent.</p><p>Fire Staircase: Kota stone.</p><p>Store/Wash Area/Utilities/Staff Lounge: Premium vitrified tiles.</p><p>Utility Dadoing: Vitrified tiles up to balcony height.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1019, 111, 7, '<p>External surfaces are finished with textured or smooth coatings using two coats of premium exterior paint as per architectural design. Internal walls receive putty, primer, and premium emulsion paint. Sit-out and utility walls are finished with weatherproof paint, while basement and parking areas feature waterproof cement paint over primer-coated surfaces.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1020, 111, 8, '<p>The kitchen is supplied with softened Manjeera and borewell water and includes provisions for a dishwasher, washing machine, and other appliances. A separate water point is provided for an RO purifier.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `project_listing_specifications_mapping` (`id`, `project_listing_id`, `specifications_id`, `description`, `mapping_status`, `created_by_type`, `created_by`, `created_date`, `updated_by_type`, `updated_by`, `updated_date`, `created_ip`, `updated_ip`, `new_column`) VALUES
(1021, 111, 9, '<p>Bathrooms are equipped with HANSGROHE or equivalent premium fittings, rain showers in bedroom toilets, vanity counters with LED mirrors in master bathrooms, wall-mounted EWCs with flush valves, and imported single-lever diverters. Staff toilets are fitted with floor-mounted WCs and quality CP fittings from reputed brands.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1022, 111, 10, '<p>The project uses concealed copper wiring from reputed brands such as Finolex, RR, or Havells. Provisions are made for heat pumps, exhaust fans, kitchen appliances, washing machines, and dishwashers. Each apartment receives a three-phase power supply with individual meter boards, Legrand or equivalent MCBs, premium modular switches, and TV/audio points in living rooms and bedrooms.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1023, 111, 15, '<p>Each block is served by three high-speed passenger lifts and one fire/service lift, all equipped with rescue devices and V3F energy-efficient technology. Lifts are of reputed makes such as Mitsubishi, Toshiba, or equivalent.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1024, 111, 16, '<p>Parking is provided across six dedicated levels with visitor parking facilities as per norms. Electric vehicle charging stations are also available within the common parking areas.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1025, 111, 17, '<p>Treated borewell water is supplied through a dedicated water softening and purification plant. A sewage treatment plant of adequate capacity is provided, and treated water is reused for flushing and landscaping purposes.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1026, 111, 18, '<p>The project offers 100% DG power backup for all apartments and common areas, including air-conditioning requirements. The system includes acoustic enclosures and AMF panels for efficient operation.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1027, 111, 19, '<p>A comprehensive security system includes round-the-clock surveillance, intercom connectivity between flats and security personnel, boom barriers at entry points, panic buttons in lifts, gas leak detectors, and compound wall fencing for enhanced safety.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1028, 111, 20, '<p>The development is equipped with fire-fighting systems and safety measures that comply with all applicable fire department regulations and standards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1029, 111, 21, '<p>A centralized LPG distribution system is provided, supplying gas directly to individual flats through dedicated gas meters.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1030, 111, 24, '<p>The project also includes biometric access locks, telephone and intercom facilities, cable TV and internet connectivity, VRV air-conditioning provisions, centralized clubhouse air-conditioning, garbage collection facilities on every floor, landscaped open spaces, LED external lighting, VDF-finished driveways, a compound wall with solar fencing, rainwater harvesting systems, CCTV surveillance, and dedicated facilities for physically challenged residents including ramps, accessible parking, and safety signage.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 07:44:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1031, 112, 4, '<p><strong>:</strong> R.C.C framed structure.</p><p>8\" thick/6\" thick external walls &amp; 4\" thick internal walls with Solid Cement Blocks Masonry.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1032, 112, 5, '<ul><li><strong>Main Door:</strong> Teak wood door frame &amp; flush door shutter with veneer with melamine polish with Doorset or equivalent Hardware Fittings/SS Fittings.</li><li><strong>Internal Doors:</strong> Teak wood door frame with painted Moulded Skin panel shutter with Standard Door Set/SS Hardware Fittings.</li><li><strong>Windows:</strong> UPVC windows system with plain glass with mosquito mesh track, MS Grill with enamel paint finish. Prime or equivalent make.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1033, 112, 6, '<ul><li><strong>Living, Dining, Bed Rooms &amp; Kitchen:</strong> 2\'x2\' size Vitrified Tiles.</li><li><strong>Corridors:</strong> 2\'x2\' size Vitrified Tiles.</li><li><strong>Balconies:</strong> Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles of 1\'x1\' Size Flooring of Johnson/Kajaria or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Staircase:</strong> Tandur/Granite/Kotastone flooring</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1034, 112, 7, '<ul><li><strong>Internal:</strong> Smooth Putty finish with two coats of Premium acrylic emulsion paint.</li><li><strong>External:</strong> One Coat Primer with two coats of Acrylic emulsion paint of Asian/Berger/Nerolac or equivalent make.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1035, 112, 8, '<ul><li><strong>Platform:</strong> Black Granite Platform with Stainless Steel Sink.</li><li><strong>Water:</strong> Separate municipal water tap along with tap for bore water.</li><li><strong>Provisions:</strong> Provision for fixing of RO System, Exhaust fan, Chimney.</li><li><strong>Dado:</strong> Ceramic Tiles dado up to 2\' above platform.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1036, 112, 9, '<ul><li><strong>Sanitary:</strong> Toilets with E.W.C with Flush with Ceramic Wash Basin. CERA/Hindware or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>CP Fittings:</strong> Hot &amp; Cold water provision for showers in all Toilets with CP Fittings of CERA/Hindware-Contessa Series or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Dado:</strong> Ceramic Tiles Flooring and Ceramic tiles dado up to 7ft. Height</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1037, 112, 10, '<ul><li><strong>Wiring:</strong> Fire Resistance Electrical wires of Polycab/Finolex/Anchor or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Supply:</strong> 3 Phase supply with Individual meter, separate miniature Circuits Breakers (MCB) will be provided for light and power circuits at the main distribution box in each flat.</li><li><strong>Switches:</strong> Modular switches of Anchor/Legrand/MK or equivalent make.</li><li>Note: Detailed point-wise provisions for bedrooms, living/dining/kitchen, toilets, and balconies are also listed in the brochure.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1038, 112, 15, '<p>6 Passenger 2 Lifts of Johnson/Kone or equivalent Make with V3F drive in each Block.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1039, 112, 16, '<p>Spacious car parking</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1040, 112, 17, '<ul><li>Water Supply for all floors with Gravity based Distribution.</li><li>Sewerage Treatment plant for adequate capacity.</li><li>The water tanks, sumps, Motors, Ducts of all apartments with installations for common use.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1041, 112, 18, '<p>D.G. backup in Lifts, Common areas and all Light points in Flats except AC, Geysers and 15 Amp Points.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1042, 112, 19, '<ul><li>Sophisticated round-the-clock security system.</li><li>Surveillance cameras at the Main security, Lift and Stair cases Lobbies of each Block to Monitor.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1043, 112, 20, '<p><strong>Fire-Resistant Wiring:</strong> The project utilizes fire-resistance electrical wires from reputable brands like Polycab, Finolex, or Anchor (or equivalent) to ensure safety</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1044, 112, 21, '<p>No individual gas pipeline</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1045, 112, 24, '<ul><li><strong>Railing:</strong> MS Railing for balconies and SS Railing for staircase.</li><li><strong>Utilities:</strong> Washing Provision and Provision for Washing Machine.</li><li><strong>Utility Area Dado:</strong> Ceramic tile dado up to sill height of make Kajaria Johnson or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>TV/Telephone:</strong> Provision for Telephone point in Living Room, Internet Point in Living Room, App for communication from Security, and Provision for Cable Connection in Living Room and in Master Bedrooms.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:17:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1046, 113, 4, '<p>The 63-floor earthquake-resistant structure is precision-engineered using advanced RCC Shear Wall and Mivan technology anchored over a robust raft foundation.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1047, 113, 5, '<p>Entrances are secured via biometric locks on premium engineered wood doors, while external walls feature heavy-duty Double Glazed Unit (DGU) glass sliding systems to offer insulated, uninterrupted sky views</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1048, 113, 6, '<p>Sprawling living zones, family lounges, and bedroom suites are finished with ultra-premium vitrified tiling or high-end imported marble details to mirror luxury at every step.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1049, 113, 7, '<p>Internal masonry surfaces are treated with refined POP punning and smooth designer finishes under a ceiling layout sculpted with premium gypsum boards.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1050, 113, 8, '<p>The dual wet-and-dry kitchen layout intelligently separates active meal preparation areas from hosting zones, complete with a service utility deck and proximity to dual privacy-centric indoor and outdoor maid quarters.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1051, 113, 9, '<p>High-end Artize-inspired sanitary fixtures, premium chrome plumbing, integrated geyser provisions, and full-height wall cladding transform the five attached master bathrooms into private home sanctuaries</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1052, 113, 10, '<p>The home\'s heavy-load internal circuitry and concealed ISI-marked modular switches are fully integrated with ready appliance points and managed by an advanced prepaid metering system for effortless utility billing</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1053, 113, 15, '<p>High-speed smart passenger elevators operate smoothly across all 63 storeys under a centralized Building Management System (BMS) that guarantees proactive monitoring and a 99.9% operational uptime</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1054, 113, 16, '<p>Vehicle infrastructure spans an expansive 7-level layout consisting of 4 deep-cellar basements and 3 stilt floors providing 3 parking slots per apartment alongside modern, future-proof EV charging stations.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1055, 113, 17, '<p>Driven by a large-scale sustainable utility grid, the project features high-performance Water Treatment Plants for 24-hour purified domestic supply and an on-site Sewage Treatment Plant to cleanly recycle graywater back into the landscape.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1056, 113, 18, '<p>Proactive monitoring by the centralized BMS ensures instantaneous, automatic generator load shifting to keep critical home appliances, HVAC, and common utilities online during a grid drop.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1057, 113, 19, '<p>Continuous 24/7 AI-powered video surveillance pairs with controlled gate checkpoints, smart visitor tracking, and video doorbells to deliver an elite, 40% faster emergency response time.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1058, 113, 20, '<p>Automated smart smoke detectors, high-pressure inner hydrants, and centralized ceiling sprinkler networks across all 63 storeys are monitored directly through a high-tech emergency command center.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1059, 113, 21, '<p>Safe and continuous cooking gas is delivered straight to every culinary zone via a secure centralized piped gas network running under multi-layered isolation safety valves.&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1060, 113, 24, '<p>.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 09:40:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1061, 114, 4, '<ul><li><strong>Structure:</strong> RCC-framed structure.</li><li><strong>Super Structure:</strong> Red brick work in cement mortar.</li><li><strong>Plastering:</strong> Plastering in two coats with sponge finish</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1062, 114, 5, '<ul><li><strong>Main Door:</strong> Best teak wood frame and shutter, finished with Teak Ply/Teak Veneer, melamine polished, and featuring designer hardware.</li><li><strong>Internal Doors:</strong> Teak wood frame and designer shutters.</li><li><strong>Windows:</strong> UPVC Windows of APARNA/WINTECH or equivalent make.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1063, 114, 6, '<p><strong>Flooring:</strong> Vitrified tiles ($800\\text{mm} \\times 1600\\text{mm}$) of VARMORA or equivalent make.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1064, 114, 7, '<ul><li><strong>Internal Painting:</strong> Smooth luppam/putty finish with premium acrylic Asian paints.</li><li><strong>External Painting:</strong> Combination of premium texture/cement-based painting.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1065, 114, 8, '<ul><li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> Provisions for municipal and borewell water, and Aqua guard. (Note: Kitchen platform will not be provided).</li><li><strong>Utilities:</strong> Provision for exhaust fan, chimney, and washing machine.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1066, 114, 9, '<ul><li><strong>Bathrooms/Toilets:</strong><ul><li>CP fittings of GROHE/JAQUAR or equivalent make.</li><li>EWC and flush tank of SOMANY/GEBERIT or equivalent make.</li><li>Wall mixer with shower for hot and cold water.</li><li>Tiles up to 6\' height.</li><li>Ceramic non-slippery flooring of standard make.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Plumbing:</strong> ISI Mark CPVC piping executed by professional plumbers.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1067, 114, 10, '<ul><li><strong>Wiring:</strong> Concealed copper wiring for lights, fans, and power plug points of FINOLEX/KEI or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Power Points:</strong> Provided for cooking range, chimney, refrigerator, microwave, mixer grinder, air-conditioners (all bedrooms), and geysers (all bathrooms).</li><li><strong>Supply:</strong> 3-phase supply for each unit with an individual meter board.</li><li><strong>Fittings/Distribution:</strong> Modular electrical fittings and MCB distribution board of LEGRAND or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Telecom:</strong> Intercom facility to all flats connecting to security; provision for internet in the master bedroom and drawing room.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1068, 114, 15, '<p><strong>Lift:</strong> 5-passenger capacity lift of KONE or equivalent make with granite/vitrified tile cladding.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1069, 114, 18, '<p>MAHINDRA or equivalent make with backup for common areas, lift, and entire flat (excluding ACs and geysers).</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1070, 114, 19, '<p>CCTV camera provision.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1071, 114, 17, '<ul><li>Water Supply for all floors with Gravity based Distribution.</li><li>Sewerage Treatment plant for adequate capacity.</li><li>The water tanks, sumps, Motors, Ducts of all apartments with installations for common use.</li></ul><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1072, 114, 16, '<p>Spacious car parking</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1073, 114, 20, '<p>Fire-Resistant Wiring</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1074, 114, 21, '<p>No Seperate pipe lines</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1075, 114, 24, '<p><strong>Water Harvesting:</strong> Harvesting pit will be provided.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:10:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1076, 115, 4, '<p>Jaitra is built with an earthquake-resistant RCC framed structure designed as per IS 1893 Zone-II standards. Towers A and B feature RCC shear walls with 4-inch thick internal CC block walls, while Towers C, D, E, and F use machine-made CC blocks with 8-inch external walls and 4-inch internal walls. The structure is engineered to withstand wind and seismic loads, ensuring durability and safety.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1077, 115, 5, '<p>The main entrance door comes with an engineered wood frame and a designer flush shutter finished with veneer and UV lacquer coating. Internal doors are provided with hardwood frames and laminated designer flush shutters. French doors and windows use premium UPVC frames with glass panels, while all windows feature sliding UPVC shutters with quality glass from brands such as Saint-Gobain or equivalent.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1078, 115, 6, '<p>The living and dining areas are finished with 800 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, while bedrooms have 600 x 600 mm vitrified tile flooring. Kitchens also receive vitrified tile flooring. Bathrooms and utility areas are fitted with anti-skid ceramic tiles for safety. Granite flooring with stainless steel railings is provided in staircases and corridors, while parking areas have VDF flooring with waterproof treatment.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1079, 115, 7, '<p>All interior walls receive gypsum or putty finishing followed by a primer coat and two coats of premium acrylic emulsion paint. Exteriors feature textured finishes with two coats of weather-resistant exterior emulsion paint from reputed brands like Asian Paints or Berger.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1080, 115, 8, '<p>The kitchen is designed with provisions for water inlet and outlet points, exhaust fan connections, electrical points for appliances, and a water purifier. Additional kitchen fittings and accessories can be customized by the homeowner according to their preferences.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1081, 115, 9, '<p>Bathrooms are equipped with wall-mounted EWC closets, wash basins, premium showers, and chrome-plated fittings from reputed brands such as Kohler or Jaquar. Designer ceramic tile cladding is provided up to a height of 7 feet, and provisions for geyser connections are included. Treated water from the STP is used for flushing systems.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1082, 115, 10, '<p>The project features concealed copper wiring from reputed brands like Polycab, Havells, Anchor, or equivalent. Every apartment includes power points for air conditioners, geysers, kitchen appliances, television, internet, washing machines, and dishwashers. Modular switches are provided, and each flat has a three-phase power supply with individual prepaid energy meters and MCB protection for enhanced safety.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1083, 115, 15, '<p>Jaitra offers high-speed automatic passenger elevators from reputed brands such as Schindler, OTIS, or KONE. The lifts are equipped with group control systems, Automatic Rescue Devices (ARD), V3F drives for energy efficiency, and power backup support.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1084, 115, 16, '<p>Parking areas are developed with VDF flooring and proper waterproofing measures to ensure durability and ease of maintenance. Adequate parking facilities are provided within the project premises.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1085, 115, 17, '<p>A sewage treatment plant of adequate capacity is provided within the community. Treated water is reused for landscaping and toilet flushing, helping conserve water resources. Rainwater harvesting systems are also incorporated throughout the project to recharge groundwater levels.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1086, 115, 18, '<p>The project offers generator backup from reputed brands such as Kirloskar or Cummins. Power backup is available for common areas and all lighting points inside the apartments, excluding air conditioners and geysers. Backup capacity is 0.75 KW for 2 BHK units and 1.0 KW for 3 BHK units.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1087, 115, 19, '<p>The community is secured with a sophisticated 24/7 surveillance and security system. CCTV cameras are installed at key locations including entrances, open areas, and lift lobbies. Panic buttons and intercom facilities are provided in elevators, and the entire boundary is protected with solar-powered fencing.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1088, 115, 20, '<p>All fire protection systems and installations are designed strictly according to fire safety norms and regulations specified by the concerned fire authorities, ensuring resident safety during emergencies.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1089, 115, 21, '<p>The project provides a centralized piped gas supply system connected to all apartments. Each flat is equipped with a prepaid gas meter for convenient and efficient gas usage monitoring.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1090, 115, 24, '<p>Rooftop solar panels are connected to the common area power grid to reduce electricity consumption and improve overall energy efficiency within the community. Additionally, LED lighting is used across landscaped areas, setbacks, corridors, and staircases to support sustainable living.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:44:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1091, 116, 4, '<ul><li><strong>Structure:</strong> RCC-framed structure.</li><li><strong>Super Structure:</strong> Red brick work in cement mortar.</li><li><strong>Plastering:</strong> Plastering in two coats with sponge finish.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1092, 116, 5, '<ul><li><strong>Main Door:</strong> Best teak wood frame and shutter, finished with Teak Ply/Teak Veneer, aesthetically designed with melamine polishing, and designer hardware of reputed make.</li><li><strong>Internal Doors:</strong> Teak wood frame and designer shutters.</li><li><strong>Windows:</strong> UPVC Windows of APARNA/WINTECH or equivalent make.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1093, 116, 6, '<p><strong>Flooring:</strong> Vitrified tiles ($800\\text{mm} \\times 1600\\text{mm}$) of VARMORA or equivalent make.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1094, 116, 7, '<ul><li><strong>Internal Painting:</strong> Smooth luppam/putty finish with premium acrylic Asian paints.</li><li><strong>External Painting:</strong> Combination of Premium Texture/Cement based painting.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1095, 116, 8, '<ul><li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> Municipal and borewell water connection provision for Aqua guard.</li><li><strong>Utilities:</strong> Provision for exhaust fan, chimney, and washing machine.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1096, 116, 9, '<p><strong>Bathrooms and Toilets:</strong></p><ul><li>CP fittings of GROHE/JAQUAR or equivalent make.</li><li>EWC and flush tank of SOMANY/GEBERIT or equivalent make.</li><li>Hot and cold provisioned wall mixer with shower.</li><li>Tiles up to 6\'6\" height.</li><li>Ceramic non-slippery flooring of standard make.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1097, 116, 10, '<ul><li><strong>Electrical:</strong> Concealed copper wiring for lights, fans, and power plug points of FINOLEX/KEI or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Power Points:</strong> Outlets for cooking range, chimney, refrigerator, micro-oven, mixer grinder, air-conditioners (all bedrooms), and geysers (all bathrooms).</li><li><strong>Supply:</strong> 3 phase supply for each unit with individual meter board.</li><li><strong>Fittings:</strong> Modular electrical fittings and MCB distribution board of LEGRAND or equivalent make.</li><li><strong>Telecom:</strong> Intercom facility to all flats connecting to security; provision for Internet connection in the master bedroom and drawing room.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1098, 116, 15, '<p><strong>Lift:</strong> 6 passenger capacity lift of KONE or equivalent make with granite/vitrified tile cladding.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1099, 116, 18, '<p><strong>Generator:</strong> Power backup generator of MAHINDRA or equivalent make with backup for common areas, lift, and entire flat (excluding ACs and Geysers).</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1100, 116, 19, '<p><strong>Security:</strong> CCTV camera provision.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1101, 116, 24, '<p><strong>Harvesting Pit:</strong> A harvesting pit will be provided.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1102, 116, 21, '<p>No individual gas pipe line</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1103, 116, 20, '<p><strong>Fire-Resistant Wiring:</strong> The project utilizes fire-resistance electrical wires from reputable brands like Polycab, Finolex, or Anchor (or equivalent) to ensure safety.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1104, 116, 17, '<ul><li>Water Supply for all floors with Gravity based Distribution.</li><li>Sewerage Treatment plant for adequate capacity.</li><li>The water tanks, sumps, Motors, Ducts of all apartments with installations for common use.</li></ul>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1105, 116, 16, '<p>Spacious car parking</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 10:53:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1106, 117, 4, '<p>RCC framed structure designed to withstand wind and seismic loads as per relevant building codes. Machine-made CC block masonry in cement mortar with 6\"/8\" external walls and 4\" internal partition walls for enhanced durability and thermal efficiency</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1107, 117, 5, '<p>Main and internal doors with engineered/hardwood frames and engineered flush shutters of ALEGRIA by Praneeth Innovatives or equivalent, fitted with reputed hardware. French doors in UPVC glazed sliding design. UPVC sliding windows with plain glass and mosquito mesh. Mild steel railings provided for staircases and common areas</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1108, 117, 6, '<p>Premium double-charged vitrified tiles (600 x 600 mm) in living, dining, kitchen, and bedrooms from reputed brands such as Johnson, Nitco, Vermora, Asian, or equivalent. Anti-skid ceramic tiles in bathrooms and utility areas. Designer ceramic dado up to 7 feet height in toilets and glazed tile dado in utility spaces</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1109, 117, 7, '<p>Premium emulsion paint with smooth luppam finish for internal walls and ceilings. Exterior surfaces finished with premium weather-resistant antifungal paint with textured elevation treatment. Synthetic enamel paint for all mild steel railings and metal surfaces</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1110, 117, 8, '<p>Provision for granite platform, sink, water inlet and outlet points, and RO water connection. Electrical points provided for refrigerator, chimney, microwave oven, mixer grinder, and other kitchen appliances. Final modular kitchen works remain in the owner\'s scope</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1111, 117, 9, '<p>Premium quality sanitary ware and CP fittings. Anti-skid flooring with designer wall dado up to door height. Provision for geyser and exhaust fan points in all toilets. Plumbing lines executed with BIS-compliant PVC/UPVC pipes</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1112, 117, 10, '<p>Concealed FRLS copper wiring with modular switches from reputed brands such as Anchor Roma, Legrand, Norisys, Crabtree, or equivalent. Three-phase power supply for every apartment with individual meter boards. MCB protection for each circuit and provision for inverter backup. Dedicated power points for ACs, geysers, TV, internet, washing machine, dishwasher, RO unit, and kitchen appliances</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1113, 117, 15, '<p>Automated passenger elevators designed and installed as per National Building Code (NBC) norms. Designer-finished lift lobbies and elevator cladding with granite/tile finishes</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1114, 117, 16, '<p>Well-planned stilt and surface-level parking facilities with designated parking slots. Adequate circulation space and driveway lighting provided throughout the parking areas</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1115, 117, 17, '<p>Water supply through municipal and borewell sources supported by overhead and underground storage systems. Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) of adequate capacity provided within the project. Treated water reused for landscaping and flushing requirements, reducing fresh water consumption</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1116, 117, 18, '<p>DG power backup through Kirloskar, Cummins, Mahindra, or equivalent generators for lifts, common areas, water pumps, clubhouse facilities, and security systems</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1117, 117, 19, '<p>Gated community with 24x7 security surveillance, controlled entry and exit points, security cabins, CCTV monitoring in common areas, and well-lit internal roads and pathways</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1118, 117, 20, '<p>Fire safety systems designed as per statutory norms and local fire department requirements. Fire-fighting equipment, hydrants, extinguishers, and emergency evacuation provisions provided in common areas</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1119, 117, 21, '<p>Provision for centralized LPG supply network or dedicated LPG connection points for individual apartments, with safety-compliant piping and isolation valves as per applicable regulations. (Subject to utility provider approvals and project implementation norms.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
