(1830, 166, 4, '<p>RCC Framed Structure: Designed to withstand wind and seismic loads.Brick Work: 200mm thick external walls and 100mm thick internal walls constructed with cement concrete blocks.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1831, 166, 7, '<p>External: Sponge-finished sand-faced cement plaster painted with two coats of exterior emulsion paint, plus textured exterior paint.Internal: Smooth plastered surface treated with putty and two coats of premium acrylic emulsion paint of reputed make over a coat of primer.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1832, 166, 6, '<p>Drawing, Living, Dining: Double charged vitrified tiles (800 x 800mm) of reputed make.Pooja, Bedrooms &amp;amp; Kitchen: Double charged vitrified tiles (600 x 600mm) of reputed make.Bathrooms: Acid-resistant, anti-skid ceramic tiles of reputed make.Corridors: Matt finish vitrified tiles of reputed make.Balconies: Anti-skid ceramic tile of reputed make with a granite sill at the bottom of the railing.Utility: Anti-skid ceramic tile of reputed make with granite coping for the railing.Staircase: Anti-skid granite for treads, risers, and skirting with molding edges.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1833, 166, 5, '<p>Main Door: Best teak wood frame with teak veneered shutter, aesthetically designed, finished with melamine polish, and fixed with hardware of reputed make.Internal Doors: Engineered wood frame with flush shutter, aesthetically designed, finished with melamine polish, and fixed with hardware of reputed make.Utility Doors: UPVC door frame with a combination of tinted float glass and laminated MDF panel.Sliding Doors: UPVC sliding doors with clear glass paneled shutters and a mosquito mesh door.Windows: Two-track UPVC clear glass with suitable finishes as per design, including a mosquito mesh door.Window Grills: Aesthetically designed, mild steel (MS) window grills with an enamel paint finish are provided for all windows up to the second floor.Balcony Railing: MS railing or glass railing with reputed hardware</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1834, 166, 8, '<p>Counter: Granite platform with a stainless steel sink.Water: Separate municipal water supply provided alongside borewell water.Accessories: Provision for RO system, exhaust fan, or chimney.Cladding: Glazed ceramic tile cladding up to lintel level above the kitchen platform.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1835, 166, 9, '<p>Fixtures: Premium quality ceramic washbasin, wall-mounted EWC with concealed flush tank, and CP fittings, all of reputed make.Ceiling: PVC false ceiling in all bathrooms.Cladding: Glazed ceramic tiles dado up to false ceiling height in bathrooms and up to 4\'0\" height in the utility area.Utility: Provision for washing machine and washing utensils.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1836, 166, 10, '<p>Fixtures: Concealed copper wiring, modular switches, and MCBs for each distribution board, all of reputed make.Power Outlets: Air conditioners in drawing, living, dining, and bedrooms; geysers and exhaust fans in all bathrooms; chimney, refrigerator, microwave ovens, and mixer/grinders in the kitchen; and washing machine/dishwasher in the utility area.General: TV and internet points, and a 3-phase supply.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1837, 166, 15, '<p>Passenger: Each block features four high-speed automatic passenger elevators with V3F technology for energy efficiency, with vitrified tile flooring and granite cladding at the entrance.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1838, 166, 16, '<p>One car parking space per flat, with signage, parking tiles, and driver toilet facilities.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1839, 166, 18, '<p>Power Backup: 100% DG set backup with acoustic enclosure.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1840, 166, 17, '<p>WSP &amp;amp; STP: Fully treated water via water softening plant, and a sewage treatment plant where treated water is used for WC flushing.</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
(1841, 166, 20, '<p>Fire &amp;amp; Safety: Sprinkler and hydrant systems on all floors and basements, with fire alarms and a public address system controlled at the main security</p>', 'A', NULL, NULL, '2026-06-22 09:50:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, '169.254.169.126', NULL, NULL),
